<div class="skill skill&#95;innate" style="padding: 1em; margin-top: 1em; box-shadow:black 0 2px 5px 0;color:#c8c4bd; border:#525244 solid 1px; background:#082848 no-repeat right top; overflow:hidden; position:relative; z-index: 100;">
<div id="Prophet&#95;of&#95;an&#95;Elder&#95;God" class="skill&#95;header skill&#95;wrapper"><span class="plainlinks"><a class="text" href="https://wiki.leagueoflegends.com/en-us/Template:Data_Illaoi/Prophet_of_an_Elder_God?action=edit"><span class="button" title="Click here to edit this ability." style="float:right; text-align:center; border-radius: 2px; position:absolute; right:13px; z-index:5"><b>&#160;Edit&#160;</b></span></a></span><div class="ability-info-container"><div class="ability-info-stats&#95;&#95;wrapper">
<div class="ability-info-stats&#95;&#95;ability">Prophet of an Elder God</div>
<div class="ability-info-stats&#95;&#95;list"><div class="ability-info-stats&#95;&#95;stat"><div class="ability-info-stats&#95;&#95;stat-label"><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="Unaffected by ability haste">STATIC COOLDOWN</span>:</div><div class="ability-info-stats&#95;&#95;stat-value"><span class="pp-tooltip" style="position:relative; border-bottom:1px dotted; cursor:help;" data-start="18;" data-finish="7;" data-top-fill="18" data-bot-values="18;17.35;16.71;16.06;15.41;14.76;14.12;13.47;12.82;12.18;11.53;10.88;10.24;9.59;8.94;8.29;7.65;7;6.35;5.71;5.06;4.41;3.76;3.12;2.47;1.82;1.18;0.53;-0.12;-0.76;-1.41;-2.06;-2.71;-3.35;-4;-4.65;-5.29;-5.94;-6.59;-7.24;-7.88&#124;displayMaxColumn=18">18 – 7 (based on level)</span></div></div><div class="ability-info-stats&#95;&#95;stat"><div class="ability-info-stats&#95;&#95;stat-label">EFFECT RADIUS:</div><div class="ability-info-stats&#95;&#95;stat-value"><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="Range around a tentacle within which Illaoi cannot spawn a tentacle in.">1000</span></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="ability-json noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable"><span class="template&#95;sbc"><b>Innate:</b></span> Periodically, a <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> will spawn next to nearby <a href="/en-us/Terrain" title="Terrain">terrain</a>. It can be killed by enemy basic attacks and will become dormant if <span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Illaoi" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span title="An icon representing Illaoi"><img alt="An icon representing Illaoi" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Illaoi_OriginalSquare.png?37418" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Illaoi_OriginalSquare.png?37418 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></span></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><strong class="selflink">Illaoi</strong></span></span> leaves it alone. A <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> only attacks through <b>Illaoi's</b> abilities and does so by slamming the ground once, dealing <span style="color: #FF8C34; white-space:normal">physical damage</span> to enemies hit. Whenever it hits at least one enemy <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Champion"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Champion" title="An icon representing the keyword Champion"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Champion" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Champion_icon.png/20px-Champion_icon.png?2d7b0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Champion_icon.png/40px-Champion_icon.png?2d7b0 2x" data-file-width="200" data-file-height="200" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Champion" title="Champion">champion</a></span>, <b>Illaoi</b> is <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Heal"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Healing" title="An icon representing the keyword Heal"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Heal" src="/en-us/images/Heal_power_icon.svg?42353" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Healing" title="Healing">healed</a></span> for a portion of <span style="color: #21B053; white-space:normal">her <b>missing</b> health</span>.  </div><div class="ability-info-content"><div class="ability-info-row">
<div class="ability-info-icon"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/Illaoi_Prophet_of_an_Elder_God.png?80163" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span></div>
<div class="ability-info-description no-stats"><span class="template&#95;sbc"><b>Innate:</b></span> Periodically, <b>Illaoi</b> spawns a <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> on the nearest terrain, if no other Tentacle is around it. Tentacles fully spawn after a 2 second delay and are <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Untargetable"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Untargetable" title="An icon representing the keyword Untargetable"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Untargetable" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Untargetable_icon.png/20px-Untargetable_icon.png?c022c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Untargetable_icon.png/40px-Untargetable_icon.png?c022c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Untargetable" class="mw-redirect" title="Untargetable">untargetable</a></span> in the meantime.</div>
<div class="ability-info-stats"></div>
</div><div class="ability-info-row">
<div class="ability-info-icon"></div>
<div class="ability-info-description no-stats"><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span> are commanded to attack by <b>Illaoi's</b> <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Abilities"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Champion_ability" title="An icon representing the keyword Champion ability"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Champion ability" src="/en-us/images/Champion_ability.svg?8f232" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Champion_ability" title="Champion ability">abilities</a></span>, dealing <span style="color: #FF8C34; white-space:normal"><span class="pp-tooltip" style="position:relative; border-bottom:1px dotted; cursor:help;" data-start="9;" data-finish="180;" data-top-fill="18" data-bot-values="9;19.06;29.12;39.18;49.24;59.29;69.35;79.41;89.47;99.53;109.59;119.65;129.71;139.76;149.82;159.88;169.94;180;190.06;200.12;210.18;220.24;230.29;240.35;250.41;260.47;270.53;280.59;290.65;300.71;310.76;320.82;330.88;340.94;351;361.06;371.12;381.18;391.24;401.29;411.35&#124;displayMaxColumn=18">9 – 180 (based on level)</span> <span style="color:orange; white-space:normal">(+ 110% AD)</span> <span style="color: #7A6DFF; white-space:normal">(+ 40% AP)</span> physical damage</span> to all enemies struck, increased by <span class="pp-tooltip" style="position:relative; border-bottom:1px dotted; cursor:help;" data-top-label="&#91;&#91;File:Tentacle Smash.png&#124;20px&#124;link=&#93;&#93; Tentacle Smash&#39;s rank" data-displayformula="100% + 10% at rank 1, then 5% per rank" data-bot-values="0;10;15;20;25;30" data-top-values="0;1;2;3;4;5" data-bot-key="%">0% – 30% (based on <span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Tentacle_Smash.png/20px-Illaoi_Tentacle_Smash.png?19842" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Tentacle_Smash.png/40px-Illaoi_Tentacle_Smash.png?19842 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span> Tentacle Smash's rank)</span>.<br />Each enemy individually reduces the slam damage by 50% for every slam they were hit by in the last 0.<small>66</small> seconds, capped at 75% less damage.</div>
<div class="ability-info-stats"></div>
</div><div class="ability-info-row">
<div class="ability-info-icon"></div>
<div class="ability-info-description no-stats">Each <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> also <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Heal"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Healing" title="An icon representing the keyword Heal"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Heal" src="/en-us/images/Heal_power_icon.svg?42353" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Healing" title="Healing">heals</a></span> <b>Illaoi</b> for <span style="color: #21B053; white-space:normal">5% of her <b>missing</b> health</span> if it hits at least one enemy <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Champion"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Champion" title="An icon representing the keyword Champion"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Champion" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Champion_icon.png/20px-Champion_icon.png?2d7b0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Champion_icon.png/40px-Champion_icon.png?2d7b0 2x" data-file-width="200" data-file-height="200" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Champion" title="Champion">champion</a></span>.</div>
<div class="ability-info-stats"></div>
</div><div class="ability-info-row">
<div class="ability-info-icon"></div>
