<div style="padding:0.5em 1em;"><div class="infobox"><div class="infobox-section-stacked"><div class="infobox-data-row"><div class="infobox-data-label">Targeting input</div><div class="infobox-data-value"><a href="/en-us/Passive_and_active_spell" title="Passive and active spell">Passive</a></div></div><div class="infobox-section-stacked"><div class="infobox-data-row"><div class="infobox-data-label">Affects</div><div class="infobox-data-value">Enemies</div></div></div></div><div class="infobox-header">Damage classification</div><div class="infobox-section-cell"><div class="infobox-data-row"><div class="infobox-data-label">Type</div><div class="infobox-data-value"><span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Area damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Area damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Area damage" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Ziggs_Mega_Inferno_Bomb.png/56px-Ziggs_Mega_Inferno_Bomb.png?af8a4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/Ziggs_Mega_Inferno_Bomb.png?af8a4 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span><br /><a href="/en-us/Damage" title="Damage">Area damage</a></span></div></div><div class="infobox-data-row"><div class="infobox-data-label">Sub-type(s)</div><div class="infobox-data-value"><span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Physical damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Physical_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Physical damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Physical damage" src="/en-us/images/Attack_damage.svg?4c659" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span><br /><a href="/en-us/Physical_damage" title="Physical damage">Physical</a></span></div></div></div><div class="infobox-header">Counters</div><div class="infobox-section-cell"><div class="infobox-data-row"><div class="infobox-data-label">Spell shield</div><div class="infobox-data-value"><span title="This ability will be blocked by spell shields. • Edge of Night • Banshee&#39;s Veil • Nocturne&#39;s Shroud of Darkness • Sivir&#39;s Spell Shield"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Sivir_Spell_Shield.png/56px-Sivir_Spell_Shield.png?4c4d1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/Sivir_Spell_Shield.png?4c4d1 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span><br />Blocked</span></div></div><div class="infobox-data-row"><div class="infobox-data-label">Projectile</div><div class="infobox-data-value"><span title="This projectile-like effect will bypass Yasuo&#39;s Wind Wall, Braum&#39;s Unbreakable, Samira&#39;s Blade Whirl, and Mel&#39;s Rebuttal."><span class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/Projectile_Grey.png?6c022" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span><br />Not Blocked</span></div></div></div><div class="infobox-section-cell"><div class="infobox-data-value" style="text-align:center;"><b>NOTICE TO API USERS:</b><br />Damage classifications are being amended across the League of Legends Wiki and also being refactored into the "Damage Info" tab.</div></div></div>
<ul><li><b>Illaoi</b> cannot spawn <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span> on ally invulnerable <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Turrets"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Turret" title="An icon representing the keyword Turret"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Turret" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Turret_icon.png/20px-Turret_icon.png?74c22" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Turret_icon.png/40px-Turret_icon.png?74c22 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Turret" title="Turret">structures</a></span> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D8r_7zpD3tY">[1]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="Added undocumented in 9.13">(note)</span></sup>, in addition to neither her nor the <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> being able to spawn them in <a href="/en-us/Nexus_Obelisk" title="Nexus Obelisk">Nexus Obelisk's</a> attack range.
<ul><li>When the <a href="/en-us/Inhibitor" title="Inhibitor">inhibitor</a> is down, <i>Nexus turrets</i> will only have a single hardcoded valid space on each of their external sides to spawn <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span> on. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xJ4Jwm7jhZ8">[2]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="Added undocumented in 9.13. This may be intended to guarantee at least 2 Tentacles spawn around the Nexus without issues with the spawn density limit">(note)</span></sup></li></ul></li>
<li><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span> are prevented from spawning on <a href="/en-us/Base_gate" title="Base gate">base gates</a>.</li>
<li>If multiple <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span> hit simultaneously, the received healing is calculated iteratively based on the new amount of <b>missing</b> health, as per this formula: <span style="color: #21B053; white-space:normal">(<b>maximum</b> health&#160;&#8722;&#160;<b>current</b> health)</span>&#160;&#215;&#160;(1&#160;&#8722;&#160;0.95<sup>n</sup>), with 'n' the number of <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> hits.
<ul><li>Because the healing is calculated iteratively, <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Grievous wounds"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Grievous_Wounds" title="An icon representing the keyword Grievous wounds"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Grievous wounds" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Grievous_Wounds_icon.png/20px-Grievous_Wounds_icon.png?053fa" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Grievous_Wounds_icon.png/40px-Grievous_Wounds_icon.png?053fa 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Grievous_Wounds" title="Grievous Wounds">Grievous Wounds</a></span> ends up slightly less effective than its nominal value, since the reduced healing leaves more <span style="color: #21B053; white-space:normal"><b>missing</b> health</span> on each subsequent <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> hit.</li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li>A slam that extends the damage reduction window to reduce the damage of a successive slam that would otherwise not have been reduced, can have its contribution of damage effectivelly negated or even outweighted by the window extension. For example, a slam reduced to 25% damage may be the cause of a successive slam being reduced from 100% to 50% damage - reducing the damage by 50% with only a contribution of 25%. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0LZq1K93P40">[3]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GYSZiIaCleE">[4]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup>
<ul><li>The expectation would instead be for slam damage to follow the formula (200%&#160;&#8722;&#160;damage% of slams in the last 0.<small>66</small>s)&#160;&#247;&#160;2, which would result in the successive slam from the above example to be reduced from 100% to <span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="(200%&#160;−&#160;25%)&#160;÷&#160;2">87.<small>5</small>%</span> damage - reducing the damage by 12.<small>5</small>% with a contribution of 25%.</li></ul></li>
<li>The healing applies after <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Omnivamp"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Vamp#Omnivamp" title="An icon representing the keyword Omnivamp"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Omnivamp" src="/en-us/images/Omnivamp_colored_icon.svg?8811b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Vamp#Omnivamp" title="Vamp">omnivamp</a></span>.</li></ul>
