tion with spell shields. See the notes for more details. • Edge of Night • Banshee&#39;s Veil • Nocturne&#39;s Shroud of Darkness • Sivir&#39;s Spell Shield"><span class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/Spell_Shield_Partly.png?af216" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span><br />See Notes</span></div></div><div class="infobox-data-row"><div class="infobox-data-label">Parries</div><div class="infobox-data-value"><span title="This ability has a special interaction with effects that mitigate basic attacks. See the notes for more details. • Nilah&#39;s Jubilant Veil • Jax&#39;s Counter Strike • Shen&#39;s Spirit&#39;s Refuge • Teemo&#39;s Blinding Dart"><span class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/Spirit%27s_Refuge_Partly.png?284ac" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span><br />See Notes</span></div></div><div class="infobox-data-row"><div class="infobox-data-label">Grounded</div><div class="infobox-data-value"><span title="This ability&#39;s interaction with roots and grounding effects is complicated. See the notes for more details."><span class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/Grounded_Partly.png?dbb11" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span><br />See Notes</span></div></div><div class="infobox-data-row"><div class="infobox-data-label">Knockdown</div><div class="infobox-data-value"><span title="This ability&#39;s interaction with knockdown effects is complicated. See the notes for more details."><span class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/Knockdown_Partly.png?85100" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span><br />See Notes</span></div></div></div><div class="infobox-section-cell"><div class="infobox-data-value" style="text-align:center;"><b>NOTICE TO API USERS:</b><br />Damage classifications are being amended across the League of Legends Wiki and also being refactored into the "Damage Info" tab.</div></div></div>
<ul><li>The damage of <i>Harsh Lesson's</i> attack portion is tagged as <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Basic damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Basic damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Basic damage" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Basic_Attack.png/20px-Basic_Attack.png?66a25" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Basic_Attack.png/40px-Basic_Attack.png?66a25 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Damage" title="Damage">basic damage</a></span> and <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Spell damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Ability damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Ability damage" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Annie_Disintegrate.png/20px-Annie_Disintegrate.png?bbde6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Annie_Disintegrate.png/40px-Annie_Disintegrate.png?bbde6 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Damage" title="Damage">spell damage</a></span>, while the <b>additional</b> damage is only tagged as <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Spell damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Ability damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Ability damage" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Annie_Disintegrate.png/20px-Annie_Disintegrate.png?bbde6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Annie_Disintegrate.png/40px-Annie_Disintegrate.png?bbde6 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Damage" title="Damage">spell damage</a></span>.
<ul><li>This causes it to potentially trigger <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Spell effects"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Ability_effects" title="An icon representing the keyword Ability effects"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Ability effects" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Blackfire_Torch_item.png/20px-Blackfire_Torch_item.png?3e150" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Blackfire_Torch_item.png/40px-Blackfire_Torch_item.png?3e150 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Ability_effects" title="Ability effects">spell effects</a></span> twice, as seen by pre-<a href="/en-us/V26.09" title="V26.09">V26.09</a> <span class="inline-image label-after rune-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-rune="Arcane Comet" data-game="lol"><span style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Arcane_Comet" title="An icon representing Arcane Comet"><img alt="An icon representing Arcane Comet" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Arcane_Comet_rune.png/20px-Arcane_Comet_rune.png?cffe0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Arcane_Comet_rune.png/40px-Arcane_Comet_rune.png?cffe0 2x" data-file-width="256" data-file-height="256" /></a></span></span> <span style="word-break: keep-all;"><a href="/en-us/Arcane_Comet" title="Arcane Comet">Arcane Comet</a></span></span> double cooldown reduction. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/em_BMVJZQMc">[9]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations. Started on V11.21">(unexpected)</span></sup></li>
<li>The <b>additional</b> damage doesn't apply <span style="color: #CC2051; white-space:normal"><span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Life_steal" title="Life steal"><img src="/en-us/images/Life_steal_icon.svg?6c8ea" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span>&#160;life steal</span></span> but it does apply <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Spell vamp"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Vamp#Spell_vamp" title="An icon representing the keyword Spell vamp"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Spell vamp" src="/en-us/images/Spell_vamp_icon.svg?684b2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Vamp#Spell_vamp" title="Vamp">spell vamp</a></span> and <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Omnivamp"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Vamp#Omnivamp" title="An icon representing the keyword Omnivamp"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Omnivamp" src="/en-us/images/Omnivamp_colored_icon.svg?8811b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Vamp#Omnivamp" title="Vamp">Omnivamp</a></span>.</li></ul></li>
<li><i>Harsh Lesson</i> cannot be cast while <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Illaoi" data-ability="Test of Spirit" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Illaoi#Test_of_Spirit" title="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Test of Spirit"><img alt="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Test of Spirit" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Test_of_Spirit.png/20px-Illaoi_Test_of_Spirit.png?06770" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Test_of_Spirit.png/40px-Illaoi_Test_of_Spirit.png?06770 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Test_of_Spirit">pulling</a></span></span> a <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span>.</li>
<li><i>Harsh Lesson</i> is made of two different abilities which are decided by <b>Illaoi's</b> range to the target, being either <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Melee"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Melee" title="An icon representing the keyword Melee"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Melee" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Melee_role.png/20px-Melee_role.png?166b1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Melee_role.png/40px-Melee_role.png?166b1 2x" data-file-width="168" data-file-height="168" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Melee" class="mw-redirect" title="Melee">melee</a></span> or within <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Dash"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Dash" title="An icon representing the keyword Dash"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Dash" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Dash.png/20px-Dash.png?e5c61" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Dash.png/40px-Dash.png?e5c61 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Dash" title="Dash">dash</a></span> range, causing interactions to act differently.</li></ul>
<ul><li><span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Interrupt"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Crowd_control#Disruption" title="An icon representing the keyword Interrupt"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Interrupt" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Silence_icon.png/20px-Silence_icon.png?70ec5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Silence_icon.png/40px-Silence_icon.png?70ec5 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Crowd_control#Disruption" title="Crowd control">Interrupt</a></span>:
<ul><li>The melee attack has an <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Uncancellable windup"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Basic_attack#Uncancellable_Windup" title="An icon representing the keyword Uncancellable windup"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Uncancellable windup" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Vi_Relentless_Force_2.png/20px-Vi_Relentless_Force_2.png?9f7e9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Vi_Relentless_Force_2.png/40px-Vi_Relentless_Force_2.png?9f7e9 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Basic_attack#Uncancellable_Windup" title="Basic attack">uncancellable windup</a></span>.
<ul><li>Starting the attack before triggering <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Guardian Angel" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Guardian_Angel" title="An icon for the item Guardian Angel"><img alt="An icon for the item Guardian Angel" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Guardian_Angel_item.png/20px-Guardian_Angel_item.png?da4ce" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Guardian_Angel_item.png/40px-Guardian_Angel_item.png?da4ce 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Guardian_Angel" title="Guardian Angel">Guardian Angel's</a></span></span> passive and hitting while she's in it will not cause the <i><b><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span></b></i> to slam. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3pqtZtUZMqI">[10]</a></li></ul></li>
<li>The dash attack does not have an uncancellable windup, meaning effects that can interrupt the dash will cancel the attack.
<ul><li>Unlike other empowered basic attacks, an interrupt on the dash attack will still cause the <a href="/en-us/Buff" title="Buff">buff</a> to be consumed and the ability to be put on cooldown. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TdO6v3SCzTw">[11]</a></li>
<li>That includes self effects, such as <span class="inline-image label-after spell-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-spell="Flash" data-game="lol"><span class="border icon-20" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Flash" title="An icon representing Flash"><img alt="An icon representing Flash" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Flash.png/20px-Flash.png?3cd4f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Flash.png/40px-Flash.png?3cd4f 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Flash" title="Flash">Flash</a></span></span>. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d0MDFoWYI-U">[12]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations. Added undocumented in V12.6">(unexpected)</span></sup>
<ul><li>Based on other effects, the expectation would be to either have: <i>flash</i> interrupts the <i>dash</i> but does not negate the effect (i.e <span class="champion-ability-icon"><span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Udyr" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Udyr" title="An icon representing Udyr"><img alt="An icon representing Udyr" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Udyr_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Udyr_OriginalSquare.png?fe8df" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Udyr_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Udyr_OriginalSquare.png?fe8df 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Udyr" title="Udyr">Udyr's</a></span></span> <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Udyr" data-ability="Blazing Stampede" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Udyr#Blazing_Stampede" title="An icon for Udyr&#39;s ability Blazing Stampede"><img alt="An icon for Udyr&#39;s ability Blazing Stampede" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Udyr_Blazing_Stampede.png/20px-Udyr_Blazing_Stampede.png?3f4f6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Udyr_Blazing_Stampede.png/40px-Udyr_Blazing_Stampede.png?3f4f6 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Udyr#Blazing_Stampede" title="Udyr">Blazing Stampede</a></span></span></span>, <span class="champion-ability-icon"><span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Hecarim" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Hecarim" title="An icon representing Hecarim"><img alt="An icon representing Hecarim" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Hecarim_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Hecarim_OriginalSquare.png?89760" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Hecarim_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Hecarim_OriginalSquare.png?89760 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Hecarim" title="Hecarim">Hecarim's</a></span></span> <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Hecarim" data-ability="Devastating Charge" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Hecarim#Devastating_Charge" title="An icon for Hecarim&#39;s ability Devastating Charge"><img alt="An icon for Hecarim&#39;s ability Devastating Charge" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Hecarim_Devastating_Charge.png/20px-Hecarim_Devastating_Charge.png?05447" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Hecarim_Devastating_Charge.png/40px-Hecarim_Devastating_Charge.png?05447 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Hecarim#Devastating_Charge" title="Hecarim">Devastating Charge</a></span></span></span>); <i>flash</i> is disabled (i.e <span class="champion-ability-icon"><span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Volibear" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Volibear" title="An icon representing Volibear"><img alt="An icon representing Volibear" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Volibear_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Volibear_OriginalSquare.png?b4f76" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Volibear_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Volibear_OriginalSquare.png?b4f76 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Volibear" title="Volibear">Volibear's</a></span></span> <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Volibear" data-ability="Thundering Smash" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Volibear#Thundering_Smash" title="An icon for Volibear&#39;s ability Thundering Smash"><img alt="An icon for Volibear&#39;s ability Thundering Smash" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Volibear_Thundering_Smash.png/20px-Volibear_Thundering_Smash.png?a4e6a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Volibear_Thundering_Smash.png/40px-Volibear_Thundering_Smash.png?a4e6a 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Volibear#Thundering_Smash" title="Volibear">Thundering Smash</a></span></span></span>, <span class="champion-ability-icon"><span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Rell" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Rell" title="An icon representing Rell"><img alt="An icon representing Rell" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Rell_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Rell_OriginalSquare.png?d80b8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Rell_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Rell_OriginalSquare.png?d80b8 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Rell" title="Rell">Rell's</a></span></span> <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Rell" data-ability="Ferromancy: Mount Up" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Rell#Ferromancy:_Mount_Up" title="An icon for Rell&#39;s ability Ferromancy: Mount Up"><img alt="An icon for Rell&#39;s ability Ferromancy: Mount Up" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Rell_Ferromancy-_Mount_Up.png/20px-Rell_Ferromancy-_Mount_Up.png?5e575" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Rell_Ferromancy-_Mount_Up.png/40px-Rell_Ferromancy-_Mount_Up.png?5e575 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Rell#Ferromancy:_Mount_Up" title="Rell">Ferromancy: Mount Up</a></span></span></span>); <i>flash</i> interrupts the <i>dash</i> and the effect, but the effect remains castable in melee range (i.e <span class="champion-ability-icon"><span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Rengar" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Rengar" title="An icon representing Rengar"><img alt="An icon representing Rengar" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Rengar_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Rengar_OriginalSquare.png?53142" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Rengar_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Rengar_OriginalSquare.png?53142 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Rengar" title="Rengar">Rengar's</a></span></span> <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Rengar" data-ability="Unseen Predator" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Rengar#Unseen_Predator" title="An icon for Rengar&#39;s ability Unseen Predator"><img alt="An icon for Rengar&#39;s ability Unseen Predator" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Rengar_Unseen_Predator.png/20px-Rengar_Unseen_Predator.png?75334" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Rengar_Unseen_Predator.png/40px-Rengar_Unseen_Predator.png?75334 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Rengar#Unseen_Predator" title="Rengar">Unseen Predator</a></span></span></span> <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Rengar" data-ability="Savagery" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Rengar#Savagery" title="An icon for Rengar&#39;s ability Savagery"><img alt="An icon for Rengar&#39;s ability Savagery" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Rengar_Savagery.png/20px-Rengar_Savagery.png?6a78b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Rengar_Savagery.png/40px-Rengar_Savagery.png?6a78b 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Rengar#Savagery" title="Rengar">Savagery</a></span></span>).</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li><span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Ground"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Ground" title="An icon representing the keyword Ground"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Ground" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Grounded_icon.png/20px-Grounded_icon.png?1f132" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Grounded_icon.png/40px-Grounded_icon.png?1f132 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Ground" class="mw-redirect" title="Ground">Ground</a></span>:
<ul><li>The ability can be cast, but only the melee attack can be used.</li>
<li>Exiting <i>grounding</i> after having already cast the ability, will cause the dash to hit at extremely high speed. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/feZggNZzUsE">[13]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/r65OjtegVLE">[14]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li><span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Root"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Root" title="An icon representing the keyword Root"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Root" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Root_icon.png/20px-Root_icon.png?80b80" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Root_icon.png/40px-Root_icon.png?80b80 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Root" class="mw-redirect" title="Root">Root</a></span>:
<ul><li>The ability can be cast, but only the melee attack can be used.</li>
<li>If <b>Illaoi</b> attack commands and then casts <i>Harsh Lesson</i> while <i>rooted</i>, or if she issues at any point an "Attack Move" command near the target, she is able to use the close range version within its dash range. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/c_ZnWcuaeB0">[15]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations. There have been tries to fix this bug in 9.9, 9.18 and 9.19, and yet it&#39;s still partially here.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li><span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Spell shield"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Spell_shield" title="An icon representing the keyword Spell shield"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Spell shield" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Sivir_Spell_Shield.png/20px-Sivir_Spell_Shield.png?4c4d1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Sivir_Spell_Shield.png/40px-Sivir_Spell_Shield.png?4c4d1 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Spell_shield" title="Spell shield">Spell shield</a></span>:
<ul><li>The melee attack does not pop the <i>spell shield</i>. <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations. Added undocumented in V26.10">(unexpected)</span></sup></li>
<li>The dash attack pops the <i>spell shield</i>, preventing Tentacle commands but not preventing the <b>additional</b> damage. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/V4GJQj9insc">[16]</a></li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li><span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Block"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Attack_effects#Parrying" title="An icon representing the keyword Block"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Block" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Shen_Spirit%27s_Refuge.png/20px-Shen_Spirit%27s_Refuge.png?319df" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Shen_Spirit%27s_Refuge.png/40px-Shen_Spirit%27s_Refuge.png?319df 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Attack_effects#Parrying" title="Attack effects">Block</a></span>, <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Dodge"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Attack_effects#Parrying" title="An icon representing the keyword Dodge"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Dodge" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Jax_Counter_Strike_old.png/20px-Jax_Counter_Strike_old.png?95754" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Jax_Counter_Strike_old.png/40px-Jax_Counter_Strike_old.png?95754 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Attack_effects#Parrying" title="Attack effects">dodge</a></span> and <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Blind"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Blind" title="An icon representing the keyword Blind"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Blind" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Blind_icon.png/20px-Blind_icon.png?b97a1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Blind_icon.png/40px-Blind_icon.png?b97a1 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Blind" class="mw-redirect" title="Blind">blind</a></span>:
<ul><li><i><b><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span></b></i> will slam if the melee attack is <i>blocked</i> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rTgSMOuszLU">[17]</a>, but will <b>not</b> if it's <i>dodged</i> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r02dsIN6uBs">[18]</a> or if it <i>misses</i> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AbeVcwWZdDs">[19]</a>. <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup>
<ul><li>In all cases the empowered attack <b>additional</b> damage is prevented. <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li></ul></li>
<li><i><b><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span></b></i> will slam if the dash attack is <i>blocked</i>, <i>dodged</i> or if it <i>misses</i>.
<ul><li>The empowered attack <b>additional</b> damage is dealt when the attack is <i>blocked</i> or <i>dodged</i>, but is <b>not</b> if it <i>misses</i>.</li></ul></li></ul></li>
<li>The melee attack will still hit if the target becomes <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Untargetable"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Untargetable" title="An icon representing the keyword Untargetable"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Untargetable" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Untargetable_icon.png/20px-Untargetable_icon.png?c022c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Untargetable_icon.png/40px-Untargetable_icon.png?c022c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Untargetable" class="mw-redirect" title="Untargetable">untargetable</a></span> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cUlojKtZGF8">[20]</a>, while the dash attack will <b>not</b>. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JOcA7oSdlqM">[21]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li></ul>
<ul><li><i><b><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span></b></i> will slam whether the melee or dash attack kills the target. However, for the melee attack the slam will be offset from the target. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/9qptAfCSfkM?&amp;t=63">[22]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/9qptAfCSfkM?t=171">[23]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations. Started in V26.10">(unexpected)</span></sup></li></ul>
<ul><li>The melee attack will <b>not</b> hit if the target has already <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Death"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Death" title="An icon representing the keyword Death"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Death" src="/en-us/images/Death_icon.svg?70f06" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="52" data-file-height="52" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Death" title="Death">died</a></span>, while the dash attack will hit. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2WgdlXm07cs">[24]</a>
<ul><li>In a frame perfect situation, the melee attack will also hit, however it will not make the <i><b><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span></b></i> slam. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XMGBEXrMSio">[25]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/iMkVjZLghQg?t=10m0s">[26]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations. 1. The close version is expected to cancel if it were to hit a dead target. 2. Since patch 7.23, Tentacles are supposed to slam if the target dies during the animation.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li>The melee attack triggers <i><b><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span></b></i> slams when hitting a <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Structure"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Category:Structure" title="An icon representing the keyword Structure"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Structure" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Structure_icon.png/20px-Structure_icon.png?41191" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Structure_icon.png/40px-Structure_icon.png?41191 2x" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Category:Structure" title="Category:Structure">structure</a></span>, while the dash attack does not. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/b0Jjxxy5hxg">[27]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations. Inconsistency appeared on V26.10">(unexpected)</span></sup></li></ul>
<ul><li>If <b>Illaoi</b> has an active <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Spell shield"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Spell_shield" title="An icon representing the keyword Spell shield"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Spell shield" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Sivir_Spell_Shield.png/20px-Sivir_Spell_Shield.png?4c4d1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Sivir_Spell_Shield.png/40px-Sivir_Spell_Shield.png?4c4d1 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Spell_shield" title="Spell shield">spell shield</a></span>, the melee attack will <b>not</b> trigger <i><b><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span></b></i> slams, while the dash attack will do. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sATyJjiwt9M">[28]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations. Inconsistency appeared on V26.10">(unexpected)</span></sup></li></ul>
<ul><li>The melee attack triggers <span class="inline-image label-after rune-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-rune="Hail of Blades" data-game="lol"><span style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Hail_of_Blades" title="An icon representing Hail of Blades"><img alt="An icon representing Hail of Blades" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Hail_of_Blades_rune.png/20px-Hail_of_Blades_rune.png?9b79e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Hail_of_Blades_rune.png/40px-Hail_of_Blades_rune.png?9b79e 2x" data-file-width="256" data-file-height="256" /></a></span></span> <span style="word-break: keep-all;"><a href="/en-us/Hail_of_Blades" title="Hail of Blades">Hail of Blades</a></span></span>, while the dash attack does not. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NjDAm14y1HI">[29]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li></ul>
<ul><li>If the empowered attack duration ends during the melee animation, the attack won't be empowered <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup>, but if it ends during the dash - then the buff will linger until the attack has finished. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LrBXpAhSR_M">[30]</a></li></ul>
<ul><li><b>Illaoi</b> can quickly cast other abilities after melee hitting the target, but after dash hitting there is a short delay. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P4kviRALbtk">[31]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li>
<li>Abilities cannot be buffered during the melee windup but they can be buffered during the dash windup. <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li></ul>
<ul><li>The dash is formed of two parts: one, the attack animation which upon completion triggers <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="On-attack"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Attack_effects#On_Attacking" title="An icon representing the keyword On-attack"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword On-attack" src="/en-us/images/On-attack_icon.svg?88ec8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Attack_effects#On_Attacking" title="Attack effects">on-attack</a></span> effects; two, the dash itself which upon completion deals the attack's damage and triggers <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="On-hit"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Attack_effects#On_Hitting" title="An icon representing the keyword On-hit"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword On-hit" src="/en-us/images/thumb/On-hit_icon.png/20px-On-hit_icon.png?a8736" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="17" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/On-hit_icon.png/40px-On-hit_icon.png?a8736 2x" data-file-width="173" data-file-height="146" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Attack_effects#On_Hitting" title="Attack effects">on-hit</a></span> effects.
<ul><li>Gaining attack speed will improve the first, but will not improve the second, causing a desync with the animation ending sooner and on-attack effects triggering sooner. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/hGjkCZS_EWA">[32]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LFppJ3H2-VQ&amp;t=739s">[33]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LFppJ3H2-VQ&amp;t=790s">[34]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li></ul></li>
<li>The <i><b><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span></b></i> attacking because of <i>Harsh Lesson</i> is considered to be of the same <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Cast instance"><a href="/en-us/Cast_instance" title="Cast instance">cast instance</a></span> as the basic attack, and for example will not grant additional stacks of <span class="inline-image label-after rune-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-rune="Conqueror" data-game="lol"><span style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Conqueror" title="An icon representing Conqueror"><img alt="An icon representing Conqueror" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Conqueror_rune.png/20px-Conqueror_rune.png?da75b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Conqueror_rune.png/40px-Conqueror_rune.png?da75b 2x" data-file-width="256" data-file-height="256" /></a></span></span> <span style="word-break: keep-all;"><a href="/en-us/Conqueror" title="Conqueror">Conqueror</a></span></span> and <span class="inline-image label-after rune-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-rune="Electrocute" data-game="lol"><span style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Electrocute" title="An icon representing Electrocute"><img alt="An icon representing Electrocute" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Electrocute_rune.png/20px-Electrocute_rune.png?cf324" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Electrocute_rune.png/40px-Electrocute_rune.png?cf324 2x" data-file-width="256" data-file-height="256" /></a></span></span> <span style="word-break: keep-all;"><a href="/en-us/Electrocute" title="Electrocute">Electrocute</a></span></span>.</li></ul>
<div style="clear:both"></div>
</div><p class="mw-empty-elt"></p>
