<div class="ability-json noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable"><span class="template&#95;sbc"><b>Active:</b></span> <span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Illaoi" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span title="An icon representing Illaoi"><img alt="An icon representing Illaoi" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Illaoi_OriginalSquare.png?37418" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Illaoi_OriginalSquare.png?37418 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></span></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><strong class="selflink">Illaoi</strong></span></span> reaches with a tendril in the target direction that stops upon the first enemy hit. If the target is a <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Champion"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Champion" title="An icon representing the keyword Champion"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Champion" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Champion_icon.png/20px-Champion_icon.png?2d7b0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Champion_icon.png/40px-Champion_icon.png?2d7b0 2x" data-file-width="200" data-file-height="200" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Champion" title="Champion">champion</a></span>, she rips their <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> out from them to stand before her. The <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Tether"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Tether" title="An icon representing the keyword Tether"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Tether" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Karma_Focused_Resolve.png/20px-Karma_Focused_Resolve.png?3ca72" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Karma_Focused_Resolve.png/40px-Karma_Focused_Resolve.png?3ca72 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Tether" title="Tether">tethers</a></span> to the target for a duration, dealing a portion of any damage it takes. If the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> is killed or the target leaves its range, the target will be <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Slow"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Slow" title="An icon representing the keyword Slow"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Slow" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Slow_icon.png/20px-Slow_icon.png?2e57e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Slow_icon.png/40px-Slow_icon.png?2e57e 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Slow" class="mw-redirect" title="Slow">slowed</a></span> and marked as a <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> for a duration or until they <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Takedown"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Takedown" title="An icon representing the keyword Takedown"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Takedown" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Damage_rating.png/20px-Damage_rating.png?1db75" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Damage_rating.png/40px-Damage_rating.png?1db75 2x" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Takedown" title="Takedown">takedown</a></span> <b>Illaoi</b>, spawning <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span> while marked. <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span> will autonomously attack the nearest <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> or <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span>. </div><div class="ability-info-content"><div class="ability-info-row">
<div class="ability-info-icon"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/Illaoi_Test_of_Spirit.png?06770" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span></div>
<div class="ability-info-description no-stats"><span class="template&#95;sbc"><b>Active:</b></span> <b>Illaoi</b> launches a tendril in the target direction that stops at the first enemy hit, pulling their <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> out in front of <b>Illaoi</b> over 0.<small>75</small> seconds if they are a <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Champion"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Champion" title="An icon representing the keyword Champion"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Champion" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Champion_icon.png/20px-Champion_icon.png?2d7b0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Champion_icon.png/40px-Champion_icon.png?2d7b0 2x" data-file-width="200" data-file-height="200" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Champion" title="Champion">champion</a></span>. The target is <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Tether"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Tether" title="An icon representing the keyword Tether"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Tether" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Karma_Focused_Resolve.png/20px-Karma_Focused_Resolve.png?3ca72" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Karma_Focused_Resolve.png/40px-Karma_Focused_Resolve.png?3ca72 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Tether" title="Tether">tethered</a></span> to the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> for <span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="Timer starts when the target is hit">7 seconds</span>, <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="True sight"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Sight#True_sight" title="An icon representing the keyword True sight"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword True sight" src="/en-us/images/thumb/True_Sight_icon.png/20px-True_Sight_icon.png?8830f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/True_Sight_icon.png/40px-True_Sight_icon.png?8830f 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Sight#True_sight" title="Sight">revealing</a></span> them in addition to granting <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Sight"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Sight" title="An icon representing the keyword Sight"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Sight" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Sight_icon.png/20px-Sight_icon.png?0aaf0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/Sight_icon.png?0aaf0 2x" data-file-width="26" data-file-height="26" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Sight" title="Sight">sight</a></span> of the area around them while the tether remains.</div>
<div class="ability-info-stats"></div>
</div><div class="ability-info-row">
<div class="ability-info-icon"></div>
<div class="ability-info-description">The <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> spawns with the target's <b>current</b> <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Health" title="Health"><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Health_icon.png/15px-Health_icon.png?f8c57" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Health_icon.png/30px-Health_icon.png?f8c57 2x" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span>&#160;<span style="color: #21B053; white-space:normal">health</span></span>, <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Armor" title="Armor"><img src="/en-us/images/Armor_icon.svg?e5599" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span>&#160;<span style="color:yellow; white-space:normal">armor</span></span> and <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Magic_resistance" title="Magic resistance"><img src="/en-us/images/Magic_resistance_icon.svg?42353" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span>&#160;<span style="color: #00FFFF; white-space:normal">magic resist</span></span>, and echoes a portion of the <span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="Damage calculated before modifiers">pre-mitigation damage</span> received to the tethered champion, with the last hits before it dies <span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="See notes">potentially</span> echoing reduced damage.</div>
<div class="ability-info-stats"><dl class="skill-tabs" style="letter-spacing:0.02rem;"><dt><span class="template&#95;lc"><b>Damage Transmission:</b></span></dt><dd>25 / 30 / 35 / 40 / 45% <span style="color:orange; white-space:normal">(+ 8% per 100 AD)</span></dd></dl></div>
</div><div class="ability-info-row">
<div class="ability-info-icon"></div>
<div class="ability-info-description no-stats">When the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> is killed or the target leaves tether range, the tether is severed, marking the target as a <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> for 4 seconds and <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Slow"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Slow" title="An icon representing the keyword Slow"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Slow" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Slow_icon.png/20px-Slow_icon.png?2e57e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Slow_icon.png/40px-Slow_icon.png?2e57e 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Slow" class="mw-redirect" title="Slow">slowing</a></span> them by 80% for 1.<small>5</small> seconds once the tether returns back to them. Each <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> autonomously attacks the closest <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> or <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span>, prioritizing the latter, once every <span class="pp-tooltip" style="position:relative; border-bottom:1px dotted; cursor:help;" data-displayformula="4-0.5 every 6 levels, with an up to 0.5-second delay. Cooldown starts upon starting the slam." data-bot-values="4.5;4;3.5" data-top-values="1;7;13">4.<small>5</small> / 4 / 3.<small>5</small> (based on level)</span> seconds.</div>
<div class="ability-info-stats"></div>
</div><div class="ability-info-row">
<div class="ability-info-icon"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/Illaoi_Vessel.png?1cbea" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span></div>
<div class="ability-info-description no-stats">Enemies made a <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> continuously spawn a <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> near themselves, when possible. <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span> can spawn 300 units closer to each other than when spawned by <b>Illaoi</b>.</div>
