<div class="ability-info-description no-stats"><i><b>Illaoi</b> is <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Lockout"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Terminology#Lockout" title="An icon representing the keyword Lockout"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Lockout" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Lockout_icon_2.png/20px-Lockout_icon_2.png?5e81e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Lockout_icon_2.png/40px-Lockout_icon_2.png?5e81e 2x" data-file-width="44" data-file-height="44" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Terminology#Lockout" title="Terminology">unable to act</a></span> while firing the projectile and while the target's <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> is being pulled. She also <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Sight"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Sight" title="An icon representing the keyword Sight"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Sight" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Sight_icon.png/20px-Sight_icon.png?0aaf0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/Sight_icon.png?0aaf0 2x" data-file-width="26" data-file-height="26" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Sight" title="Sight">reveals</a></span> herself while firing the projectile if there is an enemy champion <span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="See notes">nearby</span>. <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessels</span> can dispel their mark by scoring a <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Takedown"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Takedown" title="An icon representing the keyword Takedown"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Takedown" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Damage_rating.png/20px-Damage_rating.png?1db75" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Damage_rating.png/40px-Damage_rating.png?1db75 2x" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Takedown" title="Takedown">takedown</a></span> against <b>Illaoi</b>. Test of Spirit cannot be cast again until the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> dies.</i></div>
