<div style="padding:0.5em 1em;"><div class="infobox"><div class="infobox-section-stacked"><div class="infobox-data-row"><div class="infobox-data-label">Targeting input</div><div class="infobox-data-value"><a href="/en-us/Targeting#Location" title="Targeting">Location</a></div></div><div class="infobox-data-row"><div class="infobox-data-label">Target out-of-range override</div><div class="infobox-data-value">Target at maximum range (clamped)</div></div><div class="infobox-section-stacked"><div class="infobox-data-row"><div class="infobox-data-label">Affects</div><div class="infobox-data-value">Enemies</div></div></div></div><div class="infobox-header">Damage classification</div><div class="infobox-section-cell"><div class="infobox-data-row"><div class="infobox-data-label">Sub-type(s)</div><div class="infobox-data-value"><span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Physical damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Physical_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Physical damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Physical damage" src="/en-us/images/Attack_damage.svg?4c659" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Physical_damage" title="Physical damage">Physical</a></span> • <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Magic damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Magic_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Magic damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Magic damage" src="/en-us/images/Magic_damage.svg?f4db1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Magic_damage" title="Magic damage">Magic</a></span> • <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="True damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/True_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword True damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword True damage" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Hybrid_penetration.png/20px-Hybrid_penetration.png?d6752" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Hybrid_penetration.png/40px-Hybrid_penetration.png?d6752 2x" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/True_damage" title="True damage">True</a></span><br />(Echoed damage)</div></div></div><div class="infobox-header">Counters</div><div class="infobox-section-cell"><div class="infobox-data-row"><div class="infobox-data-label">Spell shield</div><div class="infobox-data-value"><span title="This ability has a special interaction with spell shields. See the notes for more details. • Edge of Night • Banshee&#39;s Veil • Nocturne&#39;s Shroud of Darkness • Sivir&#39;s Spell Shield"><span class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/Spell_Shield_Partly.png?af216" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span><br />See Notes</span></div></div><div class="infobox-data-row"><div class="infobox-data-label">Projectile</div><div class="infobox-data-value"><span title="This ability&#39;s interaction with projectile-catching effects is complicated. See the notes for more details."><span class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/Projectile_Grey.png?6c022" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span><br />See Notes</span></div></div></div><div class="infobox-section-cell"><div class="infobox-data-value" style="text-align:center;"><b>NOTICE TO API USERS:</b><br />Damage classifications are being amended across the League of Legends Wiki and also being refactored into the "Damage Info" tab.</div></div></div>
<ul><li><span style="color:red; font-family:math; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;" title="Pending for test"><span class="fas fa-vial"></span>PENDING FOR TEST:</span> The self-reveal has not been fully tested for complete confirmation. Is the ability invisible when passing nearby minions and there is no enemy champion nearby? Is the tip of the ability enough to reveal her? Whether it can collide with a minion or not? Just if she's around the exit of the fog of war, and even if she points towards the inside of the fog of war? <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/Fq2KuW55oVs">[35]</a></li>
<li>This ability will cast from wherever the caster is at the end of the cast time.
<ul><li>And will fire towards the same pointed location.</li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li>The projectile tentacle model is linked to <b>Illaoi's</b> model animation and size. However gameplay wise it is not, thus the actual hitbox being different than the position, width and length of the visible model. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uH8C8ByFH0Q">[36]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup>
<ul><li>The model will stop mid-air / vanish if <b>Illaoi</b> goes into <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Stasis"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Types_of_Crowd_Control#Stasis" title="An icon representing the keyword Stasis"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Stasis" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Stasis_icon.png/20px-Stasis_icon.png?d7c0d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Stasis_icon.png/40px-Stasis_icon.png?d7c0d 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Types_of_Crowd_Control#Stasis" title="Types of Crowd Control">stasis</a></span>, <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Sleep"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Types_of_Crowd_Control#Sleep" title="An icon representing the keyword Sleep"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Sleep" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Sleep_icon.png/20px-Sleep_icon.png?a43b9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Sleep_icon.png/40px-Sleep_icon.png?a43b9 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Types_of_Crowd_Control#Sleep" title="Types of Crowd Control">sleep</a></span> or <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Airborne"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Airborne" title="An icon representing the keyword Airborne"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Airborne" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Airborne_icon.png/20px-Airborne_icon.png?931fc" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Airborne_icon.png/40px-Airborne_icon.png?931fc 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Airborne" class="mw-redirect" title="Airborne">airborne</a></span>, however the actual hitbox will continue its trajectory unseen. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PoLVkhvhY-c">[37]</a></li></ul></li>
<li>The tendril is destroyed if <b>Illaoi</b> <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Death"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Death" title="An icon representing the keyword Death"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Death" src="/en-us/images/Death_icon.svg?70f06" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="52" data-file-height="52" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Death" title="Death">dies</a></span> before it hits a target. However, if it has already hit a target, then the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> pull will continue even if <b>Illaoi</b> has already died.</li>
<li>The tendril can be blocked by <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Projectile"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Projectile" title="An icon representing the keyword Projectile"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Projectile" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Projectile.png/20px-Projectile.png?af216" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Projectile.png/40px-Projectile.png?af216 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Projectile" title="Projectile">projectile</a></span>-destroying effects (e.g. <span class="champion-ability-icon"><span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Yasuo" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Yasuo" title="An icon representing Yasuo"><img alt="An icon representing Yasuo" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Yasuo_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Yasuo_OriginalSquare.png?efb3b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Yasuo_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Yasuo_OriginalSquare.png?efb3b 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Yasuo" title="Yasuo">Yasuo's</a></span></span> <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Yasuo" data-ability="Wind Wall" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Yasuo#Wind_Wall" title="An icon for Yasuo&#39;s ability Wind Wall"><img alt="An icon for Yasuo&#39;s ability Wind Wall" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Yasuo_Wind_Wall.png/20px-Yasuo_Wind_Wall.png?0ffbb" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Yasuo_Wind_Wall.png/40px-Yasuo_Wind_Wall.png?0ffbb 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Yasuo#Wind_Wall" title="Yasuo">Wind Wall</a></span></span></span>) and <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Spell shield"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Spell_shield" title="An icon representing the keyword Spell shield"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Spell shield" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Sivir_Spell_Shield.png/20px-Sivir_Spell_Shield.png?4c4d1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Sivir_Spell_Shield.png/40px-Sivir_Spell_Shield.png?4c4d1 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Spell_shield" title="Spell shield">spell shields</a></span>.
<ul><li>It will only be destroyed and not replicated against <span class="champion-ability-icon"><span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Mel" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Mel" title="An icon representing Mel"><img alt="An icon representing Mel" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Mel_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Mel_OriginalSquare.png?dbac6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Mel_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Mel_OriginalSquare.png?dbac6 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Mel" title="Mel">Mel's</a></span></span> <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Mel" data-ability="Rebuttal" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Mel#Rebuttal" title="An icon for Mel&#39;s ability Rebuttal"><img alt="An icon for Mel&#39;s ability Rebuttal" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Mel_Rebuttal.png/20px-Mel_Rebuttal.png?ce245" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Mel_Rebuttal.png/40px-Mel_Rebuttal.png?ce245 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Mel#Rebuttal" title="Mel">Rebuttal</a></span></span></span>.</li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li>The spirit pull is not considered a <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Crowd control"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Crowd_control" title="An icon representing the keyword Crowd control"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Crowd control" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Stun_icon.png/20px-Stun_icon.png?cacf8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Stun_icon.png/40px-Stun_icon.png?cacf8 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Crowd_control" title="Crowd control">crowd control</a></span> effect and will not be blocked by <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Cc-immune"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Crowd_control#Immunity" title="An icon representing the keyword Cc-Immune"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Cc-Immune" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Cc-immune_icon.png/20px-Cc-immune_icon.png?85815" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Cc-immune_icon.png/40px-Cc-immune_icon.png?85815 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Crowd_control#Immunity" title="Crowd control">crowd control immunity</a></span>, with the exception of <span class="champion-ability-icon"><span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Morgana" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Morgana" title="An icon representing Morgana"><img alt="An icon representing Morgana" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Morgana_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Morgana_OriginalSquare.png?03afb" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Morgana_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Morgana_OriginalSquare.png?03afb 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Morgana" title="Morgana">Morgana's</a></span></span> <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Morgana" data-ability="Black Shield" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Morgana#Black_Shield" title="An icon for Morgana&#39;s ability Black Shield"><img alt="An icon for Morgana&#39;s ability Black Shield" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Morgana_Black_Shield.png/20px-Morgana_Black_Shield.png?81c92" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Morgana_Black_Shield.png/40px-Morgana_Black_Shield.png?81c92 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Morgana#Black_Shield" title="Morgana">Black Shield</a></span></span></span>. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/Y326lhMcLZw?si=AI9KXkcXd57oKsWS&amp;t=1138">[38]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations. Special cased on V10.1">(unexpected)</span></sup></li>
<li><span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Sion" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Sion" title="An icon representing Sion"><img alt="An icon representing Sion" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Sion_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Sion_OriginalSquare.png?33ac7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Sion_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Sion_OriginalSquare.png?33ac7 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Sion" title="Sion">Sion's</a></span></span> <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> cannot be spawned during <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Sion" data-ability="Glory in Death" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Sion#Glory_in_Death" title="An icon for Sion&#39;s ability Glory in Death"><img alt="An icon for Sion&#39;s ability Glory in Death" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Sion_Glory_in_Death.png/20px-Sion_Glory_in_Death.png?b82c3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Sion_Glory_in_Death.png/40px-Sion_Glory_in_Death.png?b82c3 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Sion#Glory_in_Death" title="Sion">Glory in Death</a></span></span>. <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirits</span> created before <i>Sion's</i> <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Zombie state"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Death#Zombie_states" title="An icon representing the keyword Zombie state"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Zombie state" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Zombie_icon.png/20px-Zombie_icon.png?e263b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Zombie_icon.png/40px-Zombie_icon.png?e263b 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Death#Zombie_states" title="Death">zombie state</a></span> will remain active.</li>
<li><span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirits</span> are classified as <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Clone"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Champion_summoned_units#decoys" title="An icon representing the keyword Clone"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Clone" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Shaco_Hallucinate_2.png/20px-Shaco_Hallucinate_2.png?0ccb9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Shaco_Hallucinate_2.png/40px-Shaco_Hallucinate_2.png?0ccb9 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Champion_summoned_units#decoys" title="Champion summoned units">clones</a></span>:
<ul><li>The <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> spawns with the tethered champion's default model and size. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xWkLcM6Xs9I">[39]</a></li>
<li><span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirits</span> can only be fully targeted by <b>Illaoi's</b> team and neutral monsters. The <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit's</span> allies cannot manually select it as a valid target for spells and abilities, but they can still do so with automatically targeted effects.</li>
<li><span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirits</span> take 50% damage from <a href="/en-us/Turret" title="Turret">turrets</a>. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XocTkT-lq1c">[40]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li>
<li>Effects, like runes, may consider the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> as a champion for their stat-tracking. <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li>
<li><span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirits</span> cannot be <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Heal"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Healing" title="An icon representing the keyword Heal"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Heal" src="/en-us/images/Heal_power_icon.svg?42353" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Healing" title="Healing">healed</a></span> nor <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Shield"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Shield" title="An icon representing the keyword Shield"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Shield" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Hybrid_resistances_icon.png/20px-Hybrid_resistances_icon.png?18138" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Hybrid_resistances_icon.png/40px-Hybrid_resistances_icon.png?18138 2x" data-file-width="121" data-file-height="121" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Shield" title="Shield">shielded</a></span> (<span class="inline-image label-after rune-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-rune="Summon Aery" data-game="lol"><span style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Summon_Aery" title="An icon representing Summon Aery"><img alt="An icon representing Summon Aery" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Summon_Aery_rune.png/20px-Summon_Aery_rune.png?73fae" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Summon_Aery_rune.png/40px-Summon_Aery_rune.png?73fae 2x" data-file-width="256" data-file-height="256" /></a></span></span> <span style="word-break: keep-all;"><a href="/en-us/Summon_Aery" title="Summon Aery">Summon Aery</a></span></span> excluded).</li>
<li>Effects that are copied from the clone's caster to the clone, will also be copied from <b>Illaoi</b> to the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> (e.g <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Celestial Opposition" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Celestial_Opposition" title="An icon for the item Celestial Opposition"><img alt="An icon for the item Celestial Opposition" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Celestial_Opposition_item.png/20px-Celestial_Opposition_item.png?29dd6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Celestial_Opposition_item.png/40px-Celestial_Opposition_item.png?29dd6 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Celestial_Opposition" title="Celestial Opposition">Celestial Opposition</a></span></span>). <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.twitch.tv/octopus_general/clip/IronicFlirtyGiraffeSMOrc-xTUS9qvdl9MkKodX">[41]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li>
<li>The <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> levels up when the <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> does, gaining the target's stats per level. If the target has a resource that also increases per level (i.e <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Mana"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Mana" title="An icon representing the keyword Mana"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Mana" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Mana_resource.png/20px-Mana_resource.png?5be85" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Mana_resource.png/40px-Mana_resource.png?5be85 2x" data-file-width="168" data-file-height="168" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Mana" title="Mana">mana</a></span>), the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit's</span> lifetime will also visually increase, but not mechanically. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/upFnxNZBnLA?t=8m25s">[42]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li>
<li>Like other <i>clones</i>, killing the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> awards <span class="inline-image label-after" style="display:inline;color:#E2BA3D;white-space:pre;text-shadow:-1px 0 black,0 1px black,1px 0 black,0 -1px black;" data-param=""><span style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Gold" title="An icon representing Gold"><img alt="An icon representing Gold" src="/en-us/images/Gold_colored_icon.svg?103a5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="48" data-file-height="48" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;">25</span></span>, but unlike other <i>clones</i> it doesn't award <span style="color: #A560EB; white-space:normal"><span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Experience_(champion)" title="Experience (champion)"><img src="/en-us/images/Experience_icon.svg?219bd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="18" data-file-height="18" /></a></span>&#160;Experience</span></span>. <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="Not granting experience has been added undocumented in patch v13.6">(note)</span></sup></li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li>The <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> is <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Untargetable"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Untargetable" title="An icon representing the keyword Untargetable"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Untargetable" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Untargetable_icon.png/20px-Untargetable_icon.png?c022c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Untargetable_icon.png/40px-Untargetable_icon.png?c022c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Untargetable" class="mw-redirect" title="Untargetable">untargetable</a></span> while it is being pulled.
<ul><li>The <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit's</span> lifetime is sometimes 0.<small>25</small> seconds longer, while its <i>untargetability</i> is sometimes shorter, potentially causing <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span> to hit an inconsistent amount of times, as was easily the case pre <a href="/en-us/V25.15" title="V25.15">V25.15</a>. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lVAg2zjX-kY">[43]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li>The <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit's</span> destination is decided based on <b>Illaoi's</b> position and facing direction when the target is hit.
<ul><li>If the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> has no valid space to move to, it will get stuck and stay <i>untargetable</i> until its lifetime runs out. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6HoG_TvZHGM&amp;t=154s">[44]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.reddit.com/r/Illaoi/comments/vy3q36/new_illaoi_bug_just_dropped_lets_go/">[45]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/qa-D1A-ZGhs">[46]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/7uRmIZ4MmWk">[47]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations. Likely a 0 vector issue, similar to V10.13 when certain spells could hit enemies globally">(unexpected)</span></sup></li>
<li>The <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> will sometimes desync its visual position from its gameplay one. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/UF-5Zr0eRv8?t=614">[48]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations. Started around V26.04">(unexpected)</span></sup></li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li>If the target's health is reduced to 0 while their <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> is being pulled out, and they do not <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Death"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Death" title="An icon representing the keyword Death"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Death" src="/en-us/images/Death_icon.svg?70f06" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="52" data-file-height="52" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Death" title="Death">die</a></span> (i.e because of <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Resurrection"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Death#Ways_to_prevent_death_when_reaching_zero_health" title="An icon representing the keyword Resurrection"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Resurrection" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Revival_icon.png/20px-Revival_icon.png?4c111" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Revival_icon.png/40px-Revival_icon.png?4c111 2x" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Death#Ways_to_prevent_death_when_reaching_zero_health" title="Death">resurrection</a></span>), then the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> will still spawn with 0 health, making it <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Invulnerable"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Invulnerability" title="An icon representing the keyword Invulnerability"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Invulnerability" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Taric_Cosmic_Radiance.png/20px-Taric_Cosmic_Radiance.png?a8ab9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Taric_Cosmic_Radiance.png/40px-Taric_Cosmic_Radiance.png?a8ab9 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Invulnerability" title="Invulnerability">invulnerable</a></span>. The target will successively become a <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> when the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit's</span> lifetime expires. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cWhlnIZgSwQ">[49]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup>
<ul><li>If some effect regenerates the champion's health while they are <i>resurrecting</i>, and before the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> spawns, then the same will not apply. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h5555ttplNY">[50]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oV7pBhM88Eg">[51]</a></li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li>Grabbing the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> of <span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Viego" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Viego" title="An icon representing Viego"><img alt="An icon representing Viego" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Viego_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Viego_OriginalSquare.png?5f898" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Viego_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Viego_OriginalSquare.png?5f898 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Viego" title="Viego">Viego</a></span></span> will make the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit's</span> lifetime (the white bar below the lifebar) disappear, similar to other cases in the past. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N91Qshu-XgU">[52]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li>
<li><span style="color:red; font-family:math; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;" title="Pending for test"><span class="fas fa-vial"></span>PENDING FOR TEST:</span> Post <a href="/en-us/V12.8" title="V12.8">V12.8</a>, does grabbing the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> of an <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Kalista" data-ability="Fate&#39;s Call" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Kalista#Fate&#39;s_Call" title="An icon for Kalista&#39;s ability Fate&#39;s Call"><img alt="An icon for Kalista&#39;s ability Fate&#39;s Call" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Kalista_Fate%27s_Call.png/20px-Kalista_Fate%27s_Call.png?8154c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Kalista_Fate%27s_Call.png/40px-Kalista_Fate%27s_Call.png?8154c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Kalista#Fate&#39;s_Call" title="Kalista">Oathsworn</a></span></span> make the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> invisible? <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cApbCTz_lIQ">[53]</a></li>
<li>The <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> is immune to <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Stasis"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Types_of_Crowd_Control#Stasis" title="An icon representing the keyword Stasis"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Stasis" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Stasis_icon.png/20px-Stasis_icon.png?d7c0d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Stasis_icon.png/40px-Stasis_icon.png?d7c0d 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Types_of_Crowd_Control#Stasis" title="Types of Crowd Control">stasis</a></span> (i.e. <span class="champion-ability-icon"><span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Bard" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Bard" title="An icon representing Bard"><img alt="An icon representing Bard" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Bard_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Bard_OriginalSquare.png?d0233" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Bard_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Bard_OriginalSquare.png?d0233 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Bard" title="Bard">Bard's</a></span></span> <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Bard" data-ability="Tempered Fate" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Bard#Tempered_Fate" title="An icon for Bard&#39;s ability Tempered Fate"><img alt="An icon for Bard&#39;s ability Tempered Fate" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Bard_Tempered_Fate.png/20px-Bard_Tempered_Fate.png?b532f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Bard_Tempered_Fate.png/40px-Bard_Tempered_Fate.png?b532f 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Bard#Tempered_Fate" title="Bard">Tempered Fate</a></span></span></span>).</li></ul>
<ul><li>Echoed damage is calculated by taking the pre-mitigation damage against the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span>, applying <i>Test of Spirit's</i> damage modifier, and then capping it to the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit's</span> <span style="color: #21B053; white-space:normal"><b>current</b> health</span>. This damage will then be affected by damage modifiers (resistances and other effects) of the <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span>.
<ul><li>This order of operations allows <i>Test of Spirit</i> to deal more or less percentage of the <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel's</span> <span style="color: #21B053; white-space:normal">health</span> than would be expected:
<ol><li>Because the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit's</span> modifiers can be different from the <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel's</span>, allowing the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> to have higher or lower <a href="/en-us/Health" title="Health">effective health</a>, respectively increasing or decreasing the maximum pre-mitigated damage from killing it.</li>
<li>Because, while it would be expected to block excess pre-mitigated damage over what kills the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span>, since the cap does not consider the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit's</span> damage modifier, it may cause it to block damage before the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> is killed <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y2ASLYcuTXE">[54]</a>, or in corner cases not block excess damage even if it is killed. On the other hand, <i>Test of Spirit's</i> damage modifier is unexpectedly applied before the cap instead of after, with the same effect of potentially causing the cap to not block excess damage even if the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> is killed, or in corner cases block damage before it is killed.
<ul><li>The addition of the two, causes an increasing difference of expected damage when the pre-mitigated damage is between <code>Spirit current health&#160;&#247;&#160;Spiritmod</code> and <code>Spirit current health&#160;&#247;&#160;Emod</code>. <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li></ul></li></ol></li>
<li><b>Illaoi</b> needs <span style="color:orange; white-space:normal">937.<small>5</small> / 875 / 812.<small>5</small> / 750 / 687.<small>5</small> <b>total</b> AD</span> to reach 100% echoed damage. As per above, the damage is still dependent on the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit's</span> and <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel's</span> damage modifiers and may not always be able to deal 100% of the target's <b>current</b> health as total echoed damage.</li></ul></li>
<li>Transferred damage will apply on-damage effects, such as damage amplifiers (e.g <span class="inline-image label-after rune-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-rune="Last Stand" data-game="lol"><span style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Last_Stand" title="An icon representing Last Stand"><img alt="An icon representing Last Stand" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Last_Stand_rune.png/20px-Last_Stand_rune.png?e94e6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Last_Stand_rune.png/40px-Last_Stand_rune.png?e94e6 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="word-break: keep-all;"><a href="/en-us/Last_Stand" title="Last Stand">Last Stand</a></span></span>), <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Black Cleaver" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Black_Cleaver" title="An icon for the item Black Cleaver"><img alt="An icon for the item Black Cleaver" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Black_Cleaver_item.png/20px-Black_Cleaver_item.png?98eed" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Black_Cleaver_item.png/40px-Black_Cleaver_item.png?98eed 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Black_Cleaver" title="Black Cleaver">Black Cleaver</a></span></span>, <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Morellonomicon" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Morellonomicon" title="An icon for the item Morellonomicon"><img alt="An icon for the item Morellonomicon" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Morellonomicon_item.png/20px-Morellonomicon_item.png?e9bc2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Morellonomicon_item.png/40px-Morellonomicon_item.png?e9bc2 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Morellonomicon" title="Morellonomicon">Morellonomicon</a></span></span>, <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Executioner&#39;s Calling" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Executioner%27s_Calling" title="An icon for the item Executioner&#39;s Calling"><img alt="An icon for the item Executioner&#39;s Calling" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Executioner%27s_Calling_item.png/20px-Executioner%27s_Calling_item.png?b9445" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Executioner%27s_Calling_item.png/40px-Executioner%27s_Calling_item.png?b9445 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Executioner%27s_Calling" title="Executioner&#39;s Calling">Executioner's Calling</a></span></span>, <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Elixir of Sorcery" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Elixir_of_Sorcery" title="An icon for the item Elixir of Sorcery"><img alt="An icon for the item Elixir of Sorcery" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Elixir_of_Sorcery_item.png/20px-Elixir_of_Sorcery_item.png?8954e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Elixir_of_Sorcery_item.png/40px-Elixir_of_Sorcery_item.png?8954e 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Elixir_of_Sorcery" title="Elixir of Sorcery">Elixir of Sorcery</a></span></span>, <span class="inline-image label-after rune-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-rune="Sudden Impact" data-game="lol"><span style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Sudden_Impact" title="An icon representing Sudden Impact"><img alt="An icon representing Sudden Impact" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Sudden_Impact_rune.png/20px-Sudden_Impact_rune.png?b910d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Sudden_Impact_rune.png/40px-Sudden_Impact_rune.png?b910d 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="word-break: keep-all;"><a href="/en-us/Sudden_Impact" title="Sudden Impact">Sudden Impact</a></span></span>, <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Shadowflame" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Shadowflame" title="An icon for the item Shadowflame"><img alt="An icon for the item Shadowflame" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Shadowflame_item.png/20px-Shadowflame_item.png?d40d4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Shadowflame_item.png/40px-Shadowflame_item.png?d40d4 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Shadowflame" title="Shadowflame">Shadowflame</a></span></span>, <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="The Collector" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/The_Collector" title="An icon for the item The Collector"><img alt="An icon for the item The Collector" src="/en-us/images/thumb/The_Collector_item.png/20px-The_Collector_item.png?323cc" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/The_Collector_item.png/40px-The_Collector_item.png?323cc 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/The_Collector" title="The Collector">The Collector</a></span></span>, <span class="inline-image label-after rune-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-rune="First Strike" data-game="lol"><span style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/First_Strike" title="An icon representing First Strike"><img alt="An icon representing First Strike" src="/en-us/images/thumb/First_Strike_rune.png/20px-First_Strike_rune.png?705c4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/First_Strike_rune.png/40px-First_Strike_rune.png?705c4 2x" data-file-width="256" data-file-height="256" /></a></span></span> <span style="word-break: keep-all;"><a href="/en-us/First_Strike" title="First Strike">First Strike</a></span></span>, <span class="inline-image label-after buff-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-buff="Aspect of the Dragon" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Aspect_of_the_Dragon" title="An icon representing the Aspect of the Dragon neutral buff"><img alt="An icon representing the Aspect of the Dragon neutral buff" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Aspect_of_the_Dragon_buff.png/20px-Aspect_of_the_Dragon_buff.png?99a37" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Aspect_of_the_Dragon_buff.png/40px-Aspect_of_the_Dragon_buff.png?99a37 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Aspect_of_the_Dragon" class="mw-redirect" title="Aspect of the Dragon">Aspect of the Dragon</a></span></span> burn damage, and <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Kayn" data-ability="The Darkin Scythe A" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Kayn#The_Darkin_Scythe_A" title="An icon for Kayn&#39;s ability The Darkin Scythe A"><img alt="An icon for Kayn&#39;s ability The Darkin Scythe A" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Kayn_The_Darkin_Scythe_A.png/20px-Kayn_The_Darkin_Scythe_A.png?8770f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Kayn_The_Darkin_Scythe_A.png/40px-Kayn_The_Darkin_Scythe_A.png?8770f 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Kayn#The_Darkin_Scythe_A" title="Kayn">The Darkin Scythe</a></span></span>.
<ul><li>Echoed damage always counts as single target for the purpose of <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Omnivamp"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Vamp#Omnivamp" title="An icon representing the keyword Omnivamp"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Omnivamp" src="/en-us/images/Omnivamp_colored_icon.svg?8811b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Vamp#Omnivamp" title="Vamp">Omnivamp</a></span>.</li>
<li>Echoed damage always counts as <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Proc damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Proc damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Proc damage" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Wit%27s_End_item.png/20px-Wit%27s_End_item.png?723a1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Wit%27s_End_item.png/40px-Wit%27s_End_item.png?723a1 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Damage" title="Damage">proc damage</a></span> and thus will not doubly apply on-hit or on-spell effects versus the target (e.g. <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Liandry&#39;s Torment" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Liandry%27s_Torment" title="An icon for the item Liandry&#39;s Torment"><img alt="An icon for the item Liandry&#39;s Torment" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Liandry%27s_Torment_item.png/20px-Liandry%27s_Torment_item.png?fc551" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Liandry%27s_Torment_item.png/40px-Liandry%27s_Torment_item.png?fc551 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Liandry%27s_Torment" title="Liandry&#39;s Torment">Liandry's Torment</a></span></span>). These effects are only applied versus the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span>.</li>
<li>Some effects like <span class="inline-image label-after rune-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-rune="Sudden Impact" data-game="lol"><span style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Sudden_Impact" title="An icon representing Sudden Impact"><img alt="An icon representing Sudden Impact" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Sudden_Impact_rune.png/20px-Sudden_Impact_rune.png?b910d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Sudden_Impact_rune.png/40px-Sudden_Impact_rune.png?b910d 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="word-break: keep-all;"><a href="/en-us/Sudden_Impact" title="Sudden Impact">Sudden Impact</a></span></span> are consumed by the target first, before the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span>. Other effects like <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Hextech Alternator" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Hextech_Alternator" title="An icon for the item Hextech Alternator"><img alt="An icon for the item Hextech Alternator" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Hextech_Alternator_item.png/20px-Hextech_Alternator_item.png?288fa" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Hextech_Alternator_item.png/40px-Hextech_Alternator_item.png?288fa 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Hextech_Alternator" title="Hextech Alternator">Hextech Alternator</a></span></span> are consumed by the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> first, before the target.</li>
