Sheen_item.png/20px-Sheen_item.png?2bece" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Sheen_item.png/40px-Sheen_item.png?2bece 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Sheen" title="Sheen">Sheen</a></span></span>, <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Heartsteel" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Heartsteel" title="An icon for the item Heartsteel"><img alt="An icon for the item Heartsteel" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Heartsteel_item.png/20px-Heartsteel_item.png?be381" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Heartsteel_item.png/40px-Heartsteel_item.png?be381 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Heartsteel" title="Heartsteel">Heartsteel</a></span></span>), will cause the echoed damage to always deal double the proc damage, overwriting the source damage, potentially echoing much less or more damage than expected. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xfr76zWezZg">[55]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lNxHbtbebdY">[56]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li>Since the actual tether range uses a different calculation from the indicator, it may often appear that the tether breaks before reaching the indicator. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/Fb9M2AXVvNc?si=3pX556l51Wz4pIi0&amp;t=2325">[57]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/snn4OkzshNE?t=155">[58]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li>
<li>When the tether is broken (whether the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit's</span> lifetime ran out or the target moved out of range), the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> will <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Vanish"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Untargetability#Vanish" title="An icon representing the keyword Vanish"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Vanish" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Shaco_Hallucinate.png/20px-Shaco_Hallucinate.png?3222c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Shaco_Hallucinate.png/40px-Shaco_Hallucinate.png?3222c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Untargetability#Vanish" title="Untargetability">vanish</a></span> and move to <b>Illaoi's</b> location.
<ul><li>An <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Uncancellable windup"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Basic_attack#Uncancellable_Windup" title="An icon representing the keyword Uncancellable windup"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Uncancellable windup" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Vi_Relentless_Force_2.png/20px-Vi_Relentless_Force_2.png?9f7e9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Vi_Relentless_Force_2.png/40px-Vi_Relentless_Force_2.png?9f7e9 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Basic_attack#Uncancellable_Windup" title="Basic attack">uncancellable windup</a></span> attack may still kill the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> after it <i>vanished</i> to grant the gold, but without making the target a <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> and without echoing damage. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ph8_kGqAlOQ&amp;t=670s">[59]</a></li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li>When the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> is killed, it will remain in the same position for less than a second before moving to an unknown location. This will cancel any remaining <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> queued attacks, for the target being out of range. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/2svtm_PHEug">[60]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/dqvf_ID0UFo">[61]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/x7tXVYPXJ48">[62]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li>
<li>If the target that had its <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> pulled from them is taken into the <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Mordekaiser" data-ability="Realm of Death" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Mordekaiser#Realm_of_Death" title="An icon for Mordekaiser&#39;s ability Realm of Death"><img alt="An icon for Mordekaiser&#39;s ability Realm of Death" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Mordekaiser_Realm_of_Death.png/20px-Mordekaiser_Realm_of_Death.png?9696f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Mordekaiser_Realm_of_Death.png/40px-Mordekaiser_Realm_of_Death.png?9696f 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Mordekaiser#Realm_of_Death" title="Mordekaiser">Realm of Death</a></span></span>, the tether will break, but they will not be made into a <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span>.</li>
<li><span class="champion-ability-icon"><span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Fiora" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Fiora" title="An icon representing Fiora"><img alt="An icon representing Fiora" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Fiora_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Fiora_OriginalSquare.png?0b643" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Fiora_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Fiora_OriginalSquare.png?0b643 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Fiora" title="Fiora">Fiora's</a></span></span> <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Fiora" data-ability="Riposte" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Fiora#Riposte" title="An icon for Fiora&#39;s ability Riposte"><img alt="An icon for Fiora&#39;s ability Riposte" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Fiora_Riposte.png/20px-Fiora_Riposte.png?44ec0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Fiora_Riposte.png/40px-Fiora_Riposte.png?44ec0 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Fiora#Riposte" title="Fiora">Riposte</a></span></span></span> can be used to prevent becoming a <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> if used before the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> is killed <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2jcsdMpvZRc">[63]</a>, or while leaving the tether's range. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yI121hbf3jA">[64]</a></li></ul>
<ul><li>If the target is made a <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> while <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Resurrection"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Death#Ways_to_prevent_death_when_reaching_zero_health" title="An icon representing the keyword Resurrection"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Resurrection" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Revival_icon.png/20px-Revival_icon.png?4c111" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Revival_icon.png/40px-Revival_icon.png?4c111 2x" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Death#Ways_to_prevent_death_when_reaching_zero_health" title="Death">resurrecting</a></span>, some <i>resurrections</i> may cleanse the <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> debuff, while others will not. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sl1Iil8Ed70">[65]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h5555ttplNY">[66]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li>
<li><i>Spell shields</i> can also prevent the <i>slow</i> upon becoming a <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span>. <i>Spell shields</i> will not prevent becoming a <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> or <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span> from attacking.</li>
<li>The application of the <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Slow"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Slow" title="An icon representing the keyword Slow"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Slow" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Slow_icon.png/20px-Slow_icon.png?2e57e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Slow_icon.png/40px-Slow_icon.png?2e57e 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Slow" class="mw-redirect" title="Slow">slowing</a></span> missile cannot be blocked by <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Projectile"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Projectile" title="An icon representing the keyword Projectile"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Projectile" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Projectile.png/20px-Projectile.png?af216" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Projectile.png/40px-Projectile.png?af216 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Projectile" title="Projectile">projectile</a></span>- destroying effects (e.g. <span class="champion-ability-icon"><span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Yasuo" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Yasuo" title="An icon representing Yasuo"><img alt="An icon representing Yasuo" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Yasuo_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Yasuo_OriginalSquare.png?efb3b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Yasuo_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Yasuo_OriginalSquare.png?efb3b 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Yasuo" title="Yasuo">Yasuo's</a></span></span> <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Yasuo" data-ability="Wind Wall" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Yasuo#Wind_Wall" title="An icon for Yasuo&#39;s ability Wind Wall"><img alt="An icon for Yasuo&#39;s ability Wind Wall" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Yasuo_Wind_Wall.png/20px-Yasuo_Wind_Wall.png?0ffbb" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Yasuo_Wind_Wall.png/40px-Yasuo_Wind_Wall.png?0ffbb 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Yasuo#Wind_Wall" title="Yasuo">Wind Wall</a></span></span></span>).
<ul><li>Effects that <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Homing projectile destruction"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Projectile" title="An icon representing the keyword Homing projectile destruction"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Homing projectile destruction" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Bullet_strikethrough.png/20px-Bullet_strikethrough.png?5a522" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Bullet_strikethrough.png/40px-Bullet_strikethrough.png?5a522 2x" data-file-width="256" data-file-height="256" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Projectile" title="Projectile">destroy homing missiles</a></span> (i.e certain <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Untargetability"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Untargetable" title="An icon representing the keyword Untargetable"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Untargetable" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Untargetable_icon.png/20px-Untargetable_icon.png?c022c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Untargetable_icon.png/40px-Untargetable_icon.png?c022c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Untargetable" class="mw-redirect" title="Untargetable">untargetabilities</a></span>) will prevent the application of the <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Slow"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Slow" title="An icon representing the keyword Slow"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Slow" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Slow_icon.png/20px-Slow_icon.png?2e57e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Slow_icon.png/40px-Slow_icon.png?2e57e 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Slow" class="mw-redirect" title="Slow">slowing</a></span> missile.</li>
<li>The slowing missile will not be fired if the target is already <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Untargetability"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Untargetable" title="An icon representing the keyword Untargetable"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Untargetable" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Untargetable_icon.png/20px-Untargetable_icon.png?c022c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Untargetable_icon.png/40px-Untargetable_icon.png?c022c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Untargetable" class="mw-redirect" title="Untargetable">untargetable</a></span> when the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> dies.</li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li><b>Illaoi</b> can better see than her allies who's been <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vesseled</span>, by adding a layer of watery effects on their model. The <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> will also be let known it's debuffed, by having a layer of watery effects on its screen instead.
<ul><li>If the target becomes a <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> while <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Vanish"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Untargetability#Vanish" title="An icon representing the keyword Vanish"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Vanish" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Shaco_Hallucinate.png/20px-Shaco_Hallucinate.png?3222c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Shaco_Hallucinate.png/40px-Shaco_Hallucinate.png?3222c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Untargetability#Vanish" title="Untargetability">vanished</a></span>, the layer on their model will fail to be added. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=udxjd11eUs4">[67]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li></ul></li>
<li>The <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> status effect is a debuff that doesn't <i>persist through death</i>.</li>
<li>If the <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> debuff expires on the same server tick as the <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> becomes ready to slam, whether the slam occurs depends on which of the two spawned first. This is expected to be the <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span>, so no slam occurs.
<ul><li>The slam will occur on <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Clone"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Champion_summoned_units#decoys" title="An icon representing the keyword Clone"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Clone" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Shaco_Hallucinate_2.png/20px-Shaco_Hallucinate_2.png?0ccb9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Shaco_Hallucinate_2.png/40px-Shaco_Hallucinate_2.png?0ccb9 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Champion_summoned_units#decoys" title="Champion summoned units">clones</a></span> created after the <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> already spawned.</li></ul></li>
<li>The following table refers for interactions while <b>Illaoi</b> is firing the projectile and while the target's <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> is being pulled:</li></ul>
