<div style="padding:0.5em 1em;">
<ul><li>Other than <a href="/en-us/Area_of_effect" title="Area of effect">area of effects</a>, since damage amplifiers (e.g <span class="inline-image label-after rune-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-rune="Last Stand" data-game="lol"><span style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Last_Stand" title="An icon representing Last Stand"><img alt="An icon representing Last Stand" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Last_Stand_rune.png/20px-Last_Stand_rune.png?e94e6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Last_Stand_rune.png/40px-Last_Stand_rune.png?e94e6 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="word-break: keep-all;"><a href="/en-us/Last_Stand" title="Last Stand">Last Stand</a></span></span>), <span class="inline-image label-after buff-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-buff="Aspect of the Dragon" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Aspect_of_the_Dragon" title="An icon representing the Aspect of the Dragon neutral buff"><img alt="An icon representing the Aspect of the Dragon neutral buff" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Aspect_of_the_Dragon_buff.png/20px-Aspect_of_the_Dragon_buff.png?99a37" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Aspect_of_the_Dragon_buff.png/40px-Aspect_of_the_Dragon_buff.png?99a37 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Aspect_of_the_Dragon" class="mw-redirect" title="Aspect of the Dragon">Aspect of the Dragon</a></span></span> burn damage, and <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Kayn" data-ability="The Darkin Scythe A" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Kayn#The_Darkin_Scythe_A" title="An icon for Kayn&#39;s ability The Darkin Scythe A"><img alt="An icon for Kayn&#39;s ability The Darkin Scythe A" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Kayn_The_Darkin_Scythe_A.png/20px-Kayn_The_Darkin_Scythe_A.png?8770f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Kayn_The_Darkin_Scythe_A.png/40px-Kayn_The_Darkin_Scythe_A.png?8770f 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Kayn#The_Darkin_Scythe_A" title="Kayn">The Darkin Scythe</a></span></span> apply on the <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> and the <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> individually and as separate instances of damage, their <b>bonus</b> damage through the echo is effectively enhanced. In particular, damage amplifiers and <i>The Darkin Scyte</i> will further apply on their own echoed <b>bonus</b> damage. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SbH-Heiee0E">[68]</a>
<ul><li>The same does not apply for effects that apply post-mitigation (e.g <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Abyssal Mask" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Abyssal_Mask" title="An icon for the item Abyssal Mask"><img alt="An icon for the item Abyssal Mask" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Abyssal_Mask_item.png/20px-Abyssal_Mask_item.png?aac97" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Abyssal_Mask_item.png/40px-Abyssal_Mask_item.png?aac97 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Abyssal_Mask" title="Abyssal Mask">Abyssal Mask</a></span></span>, <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Bloodsong" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Bloodsong" title="An icon for the item Bloodsong"><img alt="An icon for the item Bloodsong" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Bloodsong_item.png/20px-Bloodsong_item.png?4a66f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Bloodsong_item.png/40px-Bloodsong_item.png?4a66f 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Bloodsong" title="Bloodsong">Bloodsong</a></span></span>).<div style="clear:both"></div></li></ul></li></ul>
