<li><i><b><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span></b></i> may spawn on base barriers. If <b>Illaoi</b> is in the center of a base barrier, all <i><b><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span></b></i> will spawn in the same position and stack over each other, making it appear as if there was only one <i><b><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span></b></i>. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ym0dCT7RmsE">[69]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup></li>
<li><b>Illaoi's</b> facing direction is decided by the position of the cursor on cast, but can also be changed mid-cast through other effects, such as <span class="inline-image label-after spell-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-spell="Flash" data-game="lol"><span class="border icon-20" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Flash" title="An icon representing Flash"><img alt="An icon representing Flash" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Flash.png/20px-Flash.png?3cd4f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Flash.png/40px-Flash.png?3cd4f 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Flash" title="Flash">Flash</a></span></span>. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5g08ajBml2U">[70]</a></li>
<li>If there are no walls nearby, spawning the last <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Illaoi" data-ability="Prophet of an Elder God" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Illaoi#Prophet_of_an_Elder_God" title="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Prophet of an Elder God"><img alt="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Prophet of an Elder God" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Prophet_of_an_Elder_God.png/20px-Illaoi_Prophet_of_an_Elder_God.png?80163" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Prophet_of_an_Elder_God.png/40px-Illaoi_Prophet_of_an_Elder_God.png?80163 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Prophet_of_an_Elder_God"><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span></a></span></span> will form a perfect hexagon.</li></ul></li>
<li><span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Spell shield"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Spell_shield" title="An icon representing the keyword Spell shield"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Spell shield" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Sivir_Spell_Shield.png/20px-Sivir_Spell_Shield.png?4c4d1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Sivir_Spell_Shield.png/40px-Sivir_Spell_Shield.png?4c4d1 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Spell_shield" title="Spell shield">Spell shields</a></span> will block the ability's damage but will not prevent <i><b><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span></b></i> from spawning.</li></ul>
<ul><li>If <b>Illaoi</b> <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Death"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Death" title="An icon representing the keyword Death"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Death" src="/en-us/images/Death_icon.svg?70f06" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="52" data-file-height="52" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Death" title="Death">dies</a></span> within 0.<small>25</small> seconds of dropping down, she will spawn buffed <i><b><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span></b></i>, but she won't manage in time to buff the already spawned ones. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rq3eihP2wdE">[71]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations. Added undocumented on 9.13">(unexpected)</span></sup></li>
<li>If <b>Illaoi</b> is near a <i><b><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span></b></i> that is about to spawn, it will spawn buffed by <i>Leap of Faith</i> even if <b>Illaoi</b> is no longer nearby.</li></ul>
<ul><li>Using <i><span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Illaoi" data-ability="Harsh Lesson" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Illaoi#Harsh_Lesson" title="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Harsh Lesson"><img alt="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Harsh Lesson" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Harsh_Lesson.png/20px-Illaoi_Harsh_Lesson.png?57d0e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Harsh_Lesson.png/40px-Illaoi_Harsh_Lesson.png?57d0e 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Harsh_Lesson">Harsh Lesson</a></span></span></i> after <b>Illaoi</b> drops down will command <i><b><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span></b></i> to immmediatelly start attacking, regardless if they were already mid animation. Any previous attack will continue to hit without an animation during the same time the second attack performs its animation. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L6bpl9fngHA">[72]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup>
<ul><li>This makes it possible for the same tentacle to reduce its own damage by having the second attack hit too fast, which is not otherwise possible. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hBBIQuzM8Xs">[73]</a></li></ul></li>
<li><i><b><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span></b></i> spawned are always sourced from <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Illaoi" data-ability="Prophet of an Elder God" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Illaoi#Prophet_of_an_Elder_God" title="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Prophet of an Elder God"><img alt="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Prophet of an Elder God" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Prophet_of_an_Elder_God.png/20px-Illaoi_Prophet_of_an_Elder_God.png?80163" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Prophet_of_an_Elder_God.png/40px-Illaoi_Prophet_of_an_Elder_God.png?80163 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Prophet_of_an_Elder_God">Prophet of an Elder God</a></span></span>, so they never benefit from <span class="inline-image label-after rune-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-rune="Axiom Arcanist" data-game="lol"><span style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Axiom_Arcanist" title="An icon representing Axiom Arcanist"><img alt="An icon representing Axiom Arcanist" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Axiom_Arcanist_rune.png/20px-Axiom_Arcanist_rune.png?f0a6e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Axiom_Arcanist_rune.png/40px-Axiom_Arcanist_rune.png?f0a6e 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="word-break: keep-all;"><a href="/en-us/Axiom_Arcanist" title="Axiom Arcanist">Axiom Arcanist's</a></span></span> damage amp, nor stack <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Spear of Shojin" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Spear_of_Shojin" title="An icon for the item Spear of Shojin"><img alt="An icon for the item Spear of Shojin" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Spear_of_Shojin_item.png/20px-Spear_of_Shojin_item.png?a8a8f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Spear_of_Shojin_item.png/40px-Spear_of_Shojin_item.png?a8a8f 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Spear_of_Shojin" title="Spear of Shojin">Spear of Shojin</a></span></span>. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtube.com/watch?v=7MKRUzDyM8k">[74]</a></li>
<li>After the buff expires, <i><b><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span></b></i> will linger for an extra 0.<small>25</small> seconds, allowing them to continue receiving commands and queuing up non-empowered attacks, while remaining not dormant. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iirLAJQKfrY">[75]</a></li></ul>
<div style="clear:both"></div>
</div><p class="mw-empty-elt"></p>
			</div></div></div>
