<table>
<tbody><tr>
<th style="vertical-align:top;">Control type
</th>
<td>The <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Illaoi" data-ability="Prophet of an Elder God" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Illaoi#Prophet_of_an_Elder_God" title="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Prophet of an Elder God"><img alt="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Prophet of an Elder God" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Prophet_of_an_Elder_God.png/20px-Illaoi_Prophet_of_an_Elder_God.png?80163" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Prophet_of_an_Elder_God.png/40px-Illaoi_Prophet_of_an_Elder_God.png?80163 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Prophet_of_an_Elder_God"><span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span></a></span></span> is commanded to attack each time a target in <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Cr"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Range" title="An icon representing the keyword Centered range"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Centered range" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Range_center.png/20px-Range_center.png?cbed4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Range_center.png/40px-Range_center.png?cbed4 2x" data-file-width="480" data-file-height="480" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Range" title="Range">950</a></span> range gets hit by <i><span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Illaoi" data-ability="Harsh Lesson" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Illaoi#Harsh_Lesson" title="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Harsh Lesson"><img alt="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Harsh Lesson" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Harsh_Lesson.png/20px-Illaoi_Harsh_Lesson.png?57d0e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Harsh_Lesson.png/40px-Illaoi_Harsh_Lesson.png?57d0e 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Harsh_Lesson">Harsh Lesson</a></span></span></i>.
<p>The <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> is also able to periodically automatically receive attack commands towards the closest <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> or <span style="color: #D929D9; white-space:normal">Spirit</span> within <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Cr"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Range" title="An icon representing the keyword Centered range"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Centered range" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Range_center.png/20px-Range_center.png?cbed4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Range_center.png/40px-Range_center.png?cbed4 2x" data-file-width="480" data-file-height="480" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Range" title="Range">950-range</a></span>, unless it's already attacking, and only 0.<small>25</small> seconds later after its last attack or <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Illaoi" data-ability="Leap of Faith" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Illaoi#Leap_of_Faith" title="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Leap of Faith"><img alt="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Leap of Faith" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Leap_of_Faith.png/20px-Illaoi_Leap_of_Faith.png?c9f51" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Leap_of_Faith.png/40px-Illaoi_Leap_of_Faith.png?c9f51 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Leap_of_Faith">Leap of Faith</a></span></span> attack-lockout period. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9QF6ALcV8Kc">[76]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations. The delay is unexpected.">(unexpected)</span></sup>
</p><p>Its attacks get queued up if it receives more than one attack command. If the target of a queued attack dies before the attack starts, their dead body will be targeted. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/V4QtaYHSVog">[77]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/EKSGdm-vnb8">[78]</a>
</p><p>If the <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> is commanded to attack by a <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Illaoi" data-ability="Harsh Lesson" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Illaoi#Harsh_Lesson" title="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Harsh Lesson"><img alt="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Harsh Lesson" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Harsh_Lesson.png/20px-Illaoi_Harsh_Lesson.png?57d0e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Harsh_Lesson.png/40px-Illaoi_Harsh_Lesson.png?57d0e 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Harsh_Lesson">Harsh Lesson</a></span></span> while inactive, it will instead queue the attack if it becomes active in the next 0.<small>5</small> seconds. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yLYMr3IZziU">[79]</a> 
</p><p>If a <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> is killed while attacking, the <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> will first finish its attack and then die, without being able to queue up other commands. <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="Added undocumented for all Tentacles in patch 9.13, while it&#39;s been documented for Leap of Faith spawned tentacles since patch 6.5">(note)</span></sup>
</p>
</td></tr>
