<tr>
<td colspan="2" style="vertical-align:top;">
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Abilities_2">Abilities</h3></div>
<dl><dt>Slam</dt></dl>
<p>The <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> damages all non-<a href="/en-us/Structure" class="mw-redirect" title="Structure">structure</a> enemies it hits along its length and <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Heal"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Healing" title="An icon representing the keyword Heal"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Heal" src="/en-us/images/Heal_power_icon.svg?42353" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Healing" title="Healing">heals</a></span> <b>Illaoi</b> if it hits at least one enemy champion.
</p>
<dl><dt>Awakening</dt></dl>
<p>The <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> awakens over 0.<small>25</small> seconds <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_-AABStf2ag">[80]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dtRRc149FO4">[81]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations. Since patch 9.13, Tentacles are not supposed to interact as if they were idle">(unexpected)</span></sup>, and remains active while <b>Illaoi</b> or a <span style="color: #E34D4C; white-space:normal">Vessel</span> are within 2000 range and not <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Death"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Death" title="An icon representing the keyword Death"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Death" src="/en-us/images/Death_icon.svg?70f06" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="52" data-file-height="52" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Death" title="Death">dead</a></span>. If none is nearby, the <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> finishes any of its ongoing attacks before becoming dormant, cancelling further queued attacks <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BS8eF1n30Co">[82]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4a3YwqgSzKQ">[83]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iH4SrivCId8">[84]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations. Since patch 9.13, Tentacles are not supposed to interact as if they were idle">(unexpected)</span></sup>. If dormant for 30 consecutive seconds, the <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> disappears.
</p><p>The <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> is lenient towards becoming dormant when <b>Illaoi</b> dies while the <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> is spawning <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0eQOqZiyM98">[85]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yLYMr3IZziU">[86]</a>, or for 1.<small>5</small> seconds after hitting <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Illaoi" data-ability="Test of Spirit" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Illaoi#Test_of_Spirit" title="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Test of Spirit"><img alt="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Test of Spirit" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Test_of_Spirit.png/20px-Illaoi_Test_of_Spirit.png?06770" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Test_of_Spirit.png/40px-Illaoi_Test_of_Spirit.png?06770 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Test_of_Spirit">Test of Spirit</a></span></span> - allowing <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span> to make a last attack on their targets.
</p>
<dl><dt>Enrage</dt></dl>
<p>The <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> is buffed by <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Illaoi" data-ability="Leap of Faith" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Illaoi#Leap_of_Faith" title="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Leap of Faith"><img alt="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Leap of Faith" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Leap_of_Faith.png/20px-Illaoi_Leap_of_Faith.png?c9f51" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Leap_of_Faith.png/40px-Illaoi_Leap_of_Faith.png?c9f51 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Leap_of_Faith">Leap of Faith</a></span></span>.
</p>
<dl><dt>Vision</dt></dl>
<p>All <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span> around 1000 range of an enemy champion are <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Sight"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Sight" title="An icon representing the keyword Sight"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Sight" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Sight_icon.png/20px-Sight_icon.png?0aaf0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/Sight_icon.png?0aaf0 2x" data-file-width="26" data-file-height="26" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Sight" title="Sight">revealed</a></span> through the <a href="/en-us/Sight" title="Sight">fog of war</a>.<br />
When about to <i><span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Illaoi" data-ability="Tentacle Smash" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Illaoi#Tentacle_Smash" title="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Tentacle Smash"><img alt="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Tentacle Smash" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Tentacle_Smash.png/20px-Illaoi_Tentacle_Smash.png?19842" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Tentacle_Smash.png/40px-Illaoi_Tentacle_Smash.png?19842 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Tentacle_Smash">slam</a></span></span></i> it <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Sight"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Sight" title="An icon representing the keyword Sight"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Sight" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Sight_icon.png/20px-Sight_icon.png?0aaf0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/Sight_icon.png?0aaf0 2x" data-file-width="26" data-file-height="26" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Sight" title="Sight">reveals</a></span> <span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="provides vision of a (circa) 200 radius centered on the initial location of the target of Harsh Lesson or a targeted Vessel">the targeted spot</span> to allies.
</p>
<dl><dt>General</dt></dl>
<p><span style="white-space:pre"><span class="inline-image label-after skin-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-skin="Battle Bear" data-champion="Illaoi" data-game="lol"><span style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Illaoi/Cosmetics" title="An icon representing Illaoi&#39;s Battle Bear skin in League of Legends"><img alt="An icon representing Illaoi&#39;s Battle Bear skin in League of Legends" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_BattleBearCircle.png/20px-Illaoi_BattleBearCircle.png?412d3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_BattleBearCircle.png/40px-Illaoi_BattleBearCircle.png?412d3 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Illaoi/Cosmetics" title="Illaoi/Cosmetics">Battle Bear Illaoi's</a></span></span></span> <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacle</span> attack indicator is smaller than other skins (with the hitbox unchanged). <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/FaDz6368evk">[87]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations.">(unexpected)</span></sup>
</p><p>If <b>Illaoi</b> is in a different dimension than her <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span> (i.e <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Mordekaiser" data-ability="Realm of Death" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Mordekaiser#Realm_of_Death" title="An icon for Mordekaiser&#39;s ability Realm of Death"><img alt="An icon for Mordekaiser&#39;s ability Realm of Death" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Mordekaiser_Realm_of_Death.png/20px-Mordekaiser_Realm_of_Death.png?9696f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Mordekaiser_Realm_of_Death.png/40px-Mordekaiser_Realm_of_Death.png?9696f 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Mordekaiser#Realm_of_Death" title="Mordekaiser">Realm of Death</a></span></span>), her <span style="color: #56C456; white-space:normal">Tentacles</span> will continue to target units in their dimension only, but they will be prevented from dealing damage. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/7IroB7Gwo5Y&amp;t=12m59s">[88]</a> <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/nXg-OutbtTs">[89]</a> <sup><span class="basic-tooltip" style="border-bottom:1px dotted gray;cursor:help;" title="This does not match expectations. Was expected to be fixed in V25.09">(unexpected)</span></sup>
</p>
</td></tr>

