<ul><li><span class="template&#95;sbc"><b>Undocumented:</b></span> Illaoi now jumps higher and slower during the leap animation. (before - <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B4TNumlko-c">[90]</a>, after - <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/hGjkCZS_EWA">[91]</a>)</li>
<li><span class="template&#95;sbc"><b>Undocumented:</b></span> While the ability is active, Tentacles are no longer commanded to attack <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="On-hit"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Attack_effects#On_Hitting" title="An icon representing the keyword On-hit"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword On-hit" src="/en-us/images/thumb/On-hit_icon.png/20px-On-hit_icon.png?a8736" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="17" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/On-hit_icon.png/40px-On-hit_icon.png?a8736 2x" data-file-width="173" data-file-height="146" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Attack_effects#On_Hitting" title="Attack effects">on-hit</a></span> without consuming the empowered attack (interacting with effects such as <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Guinsoo&#39;s Rageblade" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Guinsoo%27s_Rageblade" title="An icon for the item Guinsoo&#39;s Rageblade"><img alt="An icon for the item Guinsoo&#39;s Rageblade" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Guinsoo%27s_Rageblade_item.png/20px-Guinsoo%27s_Rageblade_item.png?570d1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Guinsoo%27s_Rageblade_item.png/40px-Guinsoo%27s_Rageblade_item.png?570d1 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Guinsoo%27s_Rageblade" title="Guinsoo&#39;s Rageblade">Guinsoo's Rageblade</a></span></span>; <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Dusk and Dawn" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Dusk_and_Dawn" title="An icon for the item Dusk and Dawn"><img alt="An icon for the item Dusk and Dawn" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Dusk_and_Dawn_item.png/20px-Dusk_and_Dawn_item.png?be79a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Dusk_and_Dawn_item.png/40px-Dusk_and_Dawn_item.png?be79a 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Dusk_and_Dawn" title="Dusk and Dawn">Dusk and Dawn</a></span></span>; <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Statikk Shiv" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Statikk_Shiv" title="An icon for the item Statikk Shiv"><img alt="An icon for the item Statikk Shiv" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Statikk_Shiv_item.png/20px-Statikk_Shiv_item.png?714b7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Statikk_Shiv_item.png/40px-Statikk_Shiv_item.png?714b7 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Statikk_Shiv" title="Statikk Shiv">Statikk Shiv</a></span></span>).  (before - <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PnBIVSfg9w8">[92]</a>)</li>
<li><span class="template&#95;sbc"><b>Undocumented / Bug:</b></span> The melee attack now triggers Tentacle slams when hitting a <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Structure"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Category:Structure" title="An icon representing the keyword Structure"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Structure" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Structure_icon.png/20px-Structure_icon.png?41191" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Structure_icon.png/40px-Structure_icon.png?41191 2x" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Category:Structure" title="Category:Structure">structure</a></span>, while the dash attack does not. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/b0Jjxxy5hxg">[93]</a></li>
<li><span class="template&#95;sbc"><b>Undocumented / Bug:</b></span> When using the melee version of the attack, <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Spell shield"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Spell_shield" title="An icon representing the keyword Spell shield"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Spell shield" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Sivir_Spell_Shield.png/20px-Sivir_Spell_Shield.png?4c4d1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Sivir_Spell_Shield.png/40px-Sivir_Spell_Shield.png?4c4d1 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Spell_shield" title="Spell shield">spell shields</a></span> no longer pop to prevent Tentacle commands. (before - <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MmVGVrsNWv0">[94]</a>, after - <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/V4GJQj9insc">[95]</a>)
<ul><li><span class="template&#95;sbc"><b>Note:</b></span> When using the dashed version of the attack, <i>spell shields</i> still pop to prevent Tentacle commands.</li></ul></li>
<li><span class="template&#95;sbc"><b>Undocumented / Bug:</b></span> The melee version of the ability no longer causes <i>Tentacles</i> to attack if <b>Illaoi</b> has an active <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Spell shield"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Spell_shield" title="An icon representing the keyword Spell shield"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Spell shield" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Sivir_Spell_Shield.png/20px-Sivir_Spell_Shield.png?4c4d1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Sivir_Spell_Shield.png/40px-Sivir_Spell_Shield.png?4c4d1 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Spell_shield" title="Spell shield">spell shield</a></span>. <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sATyJjiwt9M">[96]</a></li>
<li><span class="template&#95;sbc"><b>Undocumented / Bug:</b></span> When the melee attack kills the target, Tentacle slams are now offset from the target, while they are not from a dash attack. (before - <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/tdey_QEHkVo?t=1958">[97]</a>, after - <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/9qptAfCSfkM?&amp;t=63">[98]</a>, dash - <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/9qptAfCSfkM?t=171">[99]</a>)</li></ul></li></ul>
