ay:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Illaoi#Test_of_Spirit" title="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Test of Spirit"><img alt="An icon for Illaoi&#39;s ability Test of Spirit" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Test_of_Spirit.png/20px-Illaoi_Test_of_Spirit.png?06770" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_Test_of_Spirit.png/40px-Illaoi_Test_of_Spirit.png?06770 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Test_of_Spirit">Test of Spirit</a></span></span>.
<ul><li>Before this, <i>spell shields</i> would pop but would not block the damage of <i>Tentacle</i> slams commanded by a dashed <i>Harsh Lesson</i>, or if the tentacle was <i>awakened</i> by <b>Illaoi</b> and commanded by <i>Test of Spirit</i>. In addition, <i>Prophet of an Elder God's</i> damage reduction would not consider the <i>Tentacle</i> that popped the <i>spell shield</i>, causing the reduction to start from the third <i>Tentacle</i> hit, instead of from the second. (before - <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external autonumber" href="https://youtu.be/arIxnuq71vI">[158]</a>)</li></ul></li></ul></li>
