<ul><li>Illaoi has the 2nd highest <span style="color: #A560EB; white-space:normal"><span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Experience_(champion)" title="Experience (champion)"><img src="/en-us/images/Experience_icon.svg?219bd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="18" data-file-height="18" /></a></span>&#160;level 18</span></span> <span style="color:orange; white-space:normal"><span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Attack_damage" title="Attack damage"><img src="/en-us/images/Attack_damage_icon.svg?51c73" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span>&#160;<b>base</b> attack damage</span></span> at 150 (<span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Illaoi" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><span title="An icon representing Illaoi"><img alt="An icon representing Illaoi" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Illaoi_OriginalSquare.png?37418" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Illaoi_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Illaoi_OriginalSquare.png?37418 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></span></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><strong class="selflink">Illaoi</strong></span></span>), behind 162.<small>9</small> (<span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Mega Gnar" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Mega_Gnar" title="An icon r