<p><b>Tanks</b> excel in shrugging off incoming damage and focus on disrupting their enemies more than being significant damage threats themselves.
</p>
</div></div><div class="blue-tooltip" style=""><div style="text-align:center; font-size:0.9em; font-weight:bold; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;"><div style="background:#163474; color:#CCC;line-height:15px; padding:5px 0 5px 0; border-radius:2px;"><div style="display:inline; vertical-align:middle;"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/20px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="21" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/40px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67 2x" data-file-width="49" data-file-height="52" /></span></span></div> League of Legends content</div></div><div style="width: 550px; margin:5px; overflow:hidden;"><div style="margin-bottom:5px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Mana_resource.png/44px-Mana_resource.png?5be85" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Mana_resource.png/88px-Mana_resource.png?5be85 2x" data-file-width="168" data-file-height="168" /></span></span> <span class="tooltip-header" style="font-size: 140%; font-weight: bold;">Mana</span></div>
<p><span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Mana" title="Mana"><img src="/en-us/images/Mana_icon.svg?d5eaf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span>&#160;<b>Mana</b></span> (also known as <b>MP</b>) is a <a href="/en-us/Champion_statistic" title="Champion statistic">stat</a> that is the resource of many <a href="/en-us/Champion" title="Champion">champions</a> necessary to cast most of their <a href="/en-us/Champion_ability" title="Champion ability">abilities</a>. Mana can be restored via <a href="/en-us/Mana_regeneration" title="Mana regeneration">mana regeneration</a> and some <a href="/en-us/Champion_ability" title="Champion ability">abilities</a>, <a href="/en-us/Item" title="Item">items</a>, <a href="/en-us/Rune" title="Rune">runes</a>, and <a href="/en-us/Buff" title="Buff">buffs</a>.<br /><br /><b>Mana</b> is represented in-game by the blue bar within the HUD, indicating the champion's <b>current</b> mana and <b>maximum</b> mana. <b>Current</b> mana is reduced by expenditure through paying an ability's mana <i>cost</i>.
</p>
</div></div><div class="blue-tooltip" style=""><div style="text-align:center; font-size:0.9em; font-weight:bold; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;"><div style="background:#163474; color:#CCC;line-height:15px; padding:5px 0 5px 0; border-radius:2px;"><div style="display:inline; vertical-align:middle;"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/20px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="21" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/40px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67 2x" data-file-width="49" data-file-height="52" /></span></span></div> League of Legends content</div></div><div style="width: 550px; margin:5px; overflow:hidden;"><div style="margin-bottom:5px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Melee_role.png/44px-Melee_role.png?166b1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Melee_role.png/88px-Melee_role.png?166b1 2x" data-file-width="168" data-file-height="168" /></span></span> <span class="tooltip-header" style="font-size: 140%; font-weight: bold;">Melee</span></div>
<p><b>Melee</b> champions have a basic attack <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Range" title="Range"><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Range_icon.png/15px-Range_icon.png?ae16f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Range_icon.png/30px-Range_icon.png?ae16f 2x" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span>&#160;range</span> usually within 200 units. A melee attack does not use a projectile to deal damage, therefore not subject to effects that mitigate projectiles, like <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Yasuo" data-ability="Wind Wall" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Yasuo#Wind_Wall" title="An icon for Yasuo&#39;s ability Wind Wall"><img alt="An icon for Yasuo&#39;s ability Wind Wall" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Yasuo_Wind_Wall.png/20px-Yasuo_Wind_Wall.png?0ffbb" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Yasuo_Wind_Wall.png/40px-Yasuo_Wind_Wall.png?0ffbb 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Yasuo#Wind_Wall" title="Yasuo">Wind Wall</a></span></span>. Some champions can shift between a ranged and melee form, and certain items/runes differ for melee characters.
</p>
</div></div><div class="blue-tooltip" style=""><div style="text-align:center; font-size:0.9em; font-weight:bold; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;"><div style="background:#163474; color:#CCC;line-height:15px; padding:5px 0 5px 0; border-radius:2px;"><div style="display:inline; vertical-align:middle;"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/20px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="21" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/40px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67 2x" data-file-width="49" data-file-height="52" /></span></span></div> League of Legends content</div></div><div style="width: 550px; margin:5px; overflow:hidden;"><div style="margin-bottom:5px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Champion_icon.png/44px-Champion_icon.png?2d7b0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Champion_icon.png/88px-Champion_icon.png?2d7b0 2x" data-file-width="200" data-file-height="200" /></span></span> <span class="tooltip-header" style="font-size: 140%; font-weight: bold;">Champion</span></div>
<p><b>Champions</b> are the player-controlled characters in <a href="/en-us/League_of_Legends" title="League of Legends">League of Legends</a>. Each champion possesses unique abilities and <a href="/en-us/Champion_attributes" class="mw-redirect" title="Champion attributes">attributes</a>.
</p>
</div></div><div class="blue-tooltip" style=""><div style="text-align:center; font-size:0.9em; font-weight:bold; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;"><div style="background:#163474; color:#CCC;line-height:15px; padding:5px 0 5px 0; border-radius:2px;"><div style="display:inline; vertical-align:middle;"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/20px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="21" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/40px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67 2x" data-file-width="49" data-file-height="52" /></span></span></div> League of Legends content</div></div><div style="width: 550px; margin:5px; overflow:hidden;"><div style="margin-bottom:5px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/Heal_power_icon.svg?42353" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></span></span> <span class="tooltip-header" style="font-size: 140%; font-weight: bold;">Heal</span></div>
<p><b>Healing</b> replenishes a unit's <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Health" title="Health"><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Health_icon.png/15px-Health_icon.png?f8c57" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Health_icon.png/30px-Health_icon.png?f8c57 2x" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span>&#160;<span style="color: #21B053; white-space:normal"><b>current</b> health</span></span>, but never above their <span style="color: #21B053; white-space:normal"><b>maximum</b> health</span>.
</p>
</div></div><div class="blue-tooltip" style=""><div style="text-align:center; font-size:0.9em; font-weight:bold; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;"><div style="background:#163474; color:#CCC;line-height:15px; padding:5px 0 5px 0; border-radius:2px;"><div style="display:inline; vertical-align:middle;"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/20px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="21" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/40px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67 2x" data-file-width="49" data-file-height="52" /></span></span></div> League of Legends content</div></div><div style="width: 550px; margin:5px; overflow:hidden;"><div style="margin-bottom:5px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Untargetable_icon.png/44px-Untargetable_icon.png?c022c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/Untargetable_icon.png?c022c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span> <span class="tooltip-header" style="font-size: 140%; font-weight: bold;">Untargetable</span></div>
A unit that is <b>untargetable</b> is an invalid target; it can neither be <a href="/en-us/Unit_selection" title="Unit selection">selected</a> nor hit by most effects. Effects that have already been applied are <b>not</b> invalidated by the unit becoming untargetable, unless they are special-cased to do so.<hr style="width:90%; border:solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25); border-width:0px 0px 1px 0px;" />
<p>
Becoming untargetable will interrupt acqusition. This also causes non-champions to lose <a href="/en-us/Terminology#Aggro" title="Terminology">aggro</a>. Many untargetabilities additionally <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Homing projectile destruction"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Projectile" title="An icon representing the keyword Homing projectile destruction"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Homing projectile destruction" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Bullet_strikethrough.png/20px-Bullet_strikethrough.png?5a522" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Bullet_strikethrough.png/40px-Bullet_strikethrough.png?5a522 2x" data-file-width="256" data-file-height="256" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Projectile" title="Projectile">destroy</a></span> all incoming <a href="/en-us/Unit-targeted" class="mw-redirect" title="Unit-targeted">unit-targeted</a> <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Projectiles"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Projectile" title="An icon representing the keyword Projectile"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Projectile" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Projectile.png/20px-Projectile.png?af216" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Projectile.png/40px-Projectile.png?af216 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Projectile" title="Projectile">projectiles</a></span>.</p>
</div></div><div class="blue-tooltip" style=""><div style="text-align:center; font-size:0.9em; font-weight:bold; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;"><div style="background:#163474; color:#CCC;line-height:15px; padding:5px 0 5px 0; border-radius:2px;"><div style="display:inline; vertical-align:middle;"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/20px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="21" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/40px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67 2x" data-file-width="49" data-file-height="52" /></span></span></div> League of Legends content</div></div><div style="width: 550px; margin:5px; overflow:hidden;"><div style="margin-bottom:5px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/Champion_ability.svg?8f232" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span> <span class="tooltip-header" style="font-size: 140%; font-weight: bold;">Champion ability</span></div>
A <b>champion ability</b> (often just <b>ability</b>) is a unique action performed by and only available to a specific <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Champion"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Champion" title="An icon representing the keyword Champion"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Champion" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Champion_icon.png/20px-Champion_icon.png?2d7b0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Champion_icon.png/40px-Champion_icon.png?2d7b0 2x" data-file-width="200" data-file-height="200" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Champion" title="Champion">champion</a></span>. All of these special moves available to a champion collectively constitute their <i>kit</i>. A skill point is earned each time the champion <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Experience_(champion)" title="Experience (champion)"><img src="/en-us/images/Experience_icon.svg?219bd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="18" data-file-height="18" /></a></span>&#160;<a href="/en-us/Experience_(champion)" title="Experience (champion)">levels up</a></span>, which the player can spend on most abilities to learn them and rank them up to improve their potency.<hr style="width:90%; border:solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25); border-width:0px 0px 1px 0px;" />
<p>
<b>Champion abilities</b> can have either or both <i>active</i> and <i>passive</i> effects:
</p><ul><li>Active effects are <i>cast</i> by using their respective <a href="/en-us/Hotkey" class="mw-redirect" title="Hotkey">hotkey</a> and selecting a valid target. Most abilities require spending an amount of <a href="/en-us/Ability_resource" title="Ability resource">resource</a>, such as <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Mana" title="Mana"><img src="/en-us/images/Mana_icon.svg?d5eaf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span>&#160;<span style="color: #0099CC; white-space:normal">mana</span></span>.</li>
<li>Passive effects may simply be permanently available or are <i>cast</i> by fulfilling a requirement or using a specific command.</li></ul>
Most abilities incur a <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Cooldown" title="Cooldown"><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Cooldown_icon.png/15px-Cooldown_icon.png?50d14" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/Cooldown_icon.png?50d14 2x" data-file-width="20" data-file-height="20" /></a></span>&#160;<a href="/en-us/Cooldown" title="Cooldown">cooldown</a></span> after being cast, during which they cannot be used. This cooldown time is usually reduced by <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Ability_haste" title="Ability haste"><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Cooldown_reduction_icon.png/15px-Cooldown_reduction_icon.png?27276" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Cooldown_reduction_icon.png/30px-Cooldown_reduction_icon.png?27276 2x" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span>&#160;<span style="color: #7ADECD; white-space:normal">ability haste</span></span>. <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Spell effects"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Ability_effects" title="An icon representing the keyword Ability effects"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Ability effects" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Blackfire_Torch_item.png/20px-Blackfire_Torch_item.png?3e150" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Blackfire_Torch_item.png/40px-Blackfire_Torch_item.png?3e150 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Ability_effects" title="Ability effects">Spell effects</a></span> may trigger only when a valid ability deals damage. On-cast effects trigger upon an ability's <i>cast time</i> completing.<p class="mw-empty-elt"></p>
</div></div><div class="blue-tooltip" style=""><div style="text-align:center; font-size:0.9em; font-weight:bold; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;"><div style="background:#163474; color:#CCC;line-height:15px; padding:5px 0 5px 0; border-radius:2px;"><div style="display:inline; vertical-align:middle;"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/20px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="21" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/40px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67 2x" data-file-width="49" data-file-height="52" /></span></span></div> League of Legends content</div></div><div style="width: 550px; margin:5px; overflow:hidden;"><div style="margin-bottom:5px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Ziggs_Mega_Inferno_Bomb.png/44px-Ziggs_Mega_Inferno_Bomb.png?af8a4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/Ziggs_Mega_Inferno_Bomb.png?af8a4 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span> <span class="tooltip-header" style="font-size: 140%; font-weight: bold;">Area damage</span></div>
<b>Area damage</b> (internally, AOE) is a secondary damage tag. Most champion, <a href="/en-us/Item" title="Item">item</a> and <a href="/en-us/Rune" title="Rune">rune</a> abilities that can hit targets within a zone are usually tagged <b>Area</b>.<hr style="width:90%; border:solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25); border-width:0px 0px 1px 0px;" />
<p>
This tag is generally restrictive and has the following interactions:
</p><ul><li><span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Omnivamp" title="Omnivamp"><img src="/en-us/images/Omnivamp_icon.svg?18b64" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span>&#160;<a href="/en-us/Omnivamp" class="mw-redirect" title="Omnivamp">Omnivamp</a></span> heals with 33.<small><span style="text-decoration: overline;">3</span></small>% effectiveness on instances of <b>area damage</b> against non-champions.</li>
<li><span class="champion-ability-icon"><span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Jax" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Jax" title="An icon representing Jax"><img alt="An icon representing Jax" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Jax_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Jax_OriginalSquare.png?6209d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Jax_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Jax_OriginalSquare.png?6209d 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Jax" title="Jax">Jax's</a></span></span> <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Jax" data-ability="Counter Strike" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Jax#Counter_Strike" title="An icon for Jax&#39;s ability Counter Strike"><img alt="An icon for Jax&#39;s ability Counter Strike" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Jax_Counter_Strike.png/20px-Jax_Counter_Strike.png?a3a78" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Jax_Counter_Strike.png/40px-Jax_Counter_Strike.png?a3a78 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Jax#Counter_Strike" title="Jax">Counter Strike</a></span></span></span> grants 25% damage reduction against incoming <b>area damage</b>.</li>
<li>Various <a href="/en-us/Champion_summoned_unit" class="mw-redirect" title="Champion summoned unit">champion summoned units</a> such as <span class="champion-ability-icon"><span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Elise" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Elise" title="An icon representing Elise"><img alt="An icon representing Elise" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Elise_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Elise_OriginalSquare.png?b97b0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Elise_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Elise_OriginalSquare.png?b97b0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Elise" title="Elise">Elise's</a></span></span> <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Elise" data-ability="Spider Queen" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Elise#Spider_Queen" title="An icon for Elise&#39;s ability Spider Queen"><img alt="An icon for Elise&#39;s ability Spider Queen" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Elise_Spider_Queen.png/20px-Elise_Spider_Queen.png?a5cef" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Elise_Spider_Queen.png/40px-Elise_Spider_Queen.png?a5cef 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Elise#Spider_Queen" title="Elise">Spiderlings</a></span></span></span>, <span class="champion-ability-icon"><span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Naafiri" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Naafiri" title="An icon representing Naafiri"><img alt="An icon representing Naafiri" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Naafiri_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Naafiri_OriginalSquare.png?ccf30" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Naafiri_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Naafiri_OriginalSquare.png?ccf30 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Naafiri" title="Naafiri">Naafiri's</a></span></span> <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Naafiri" data-ability="We Are More" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Naafiri#We_Are_More" title="An icon for Naafiri&#39;s ability We Are More"><img alt="An icon for Naafiri&#39;s ability We Are More" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Naafiri_We_Are_More.png/20px-Naafiri_We_Are_More.png?4f9a0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Naafiri_We_Are_More.png/40px-Naafiri_We_Are_More.png?4f9a0 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Naafiri#We_Are_More" title="Naafiri">Packmates</a></span></span></span>, and <span class="champion-ability-icon"><span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Yorick" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Yorick" title="An icon representing Yorick"><img alt="An icon representing Yorick" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Yorick_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Yorick_OriginalSquare.png?13f0f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Yorick_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Yorick_OriginalSquare.png?13f0f 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Yorick" title="Yorick">Yorick's</a></span></span> <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Yorick" data-ability="Shepherd of Souls" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Yorick#Shepherd_of_Souls" title="An icon for Yorick&#39;s ability Shepherd of Souls"><img alt="An icon for Yorick&#39;s ability Shepherd of Souls" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Yorick_Shepherd_of_Souls.png/20px-Yorick_Shepherd_of_Souls.png?21feb" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Yorick_Shepherd_of_Souls.png/40px-Yorick_Shepherd_of_Souls.png?21feb 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Yorick#Shepherd_of_Souls" title="Yorick">Mist Walkers</a></span></span></span> take reduced damage from <b>area damage</b> effects.<p class="mw-empty-elt"></p></li></ul>

<p>
Effects triggered due to damage type (<span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Physical damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Physical_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Physical damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Physical damage" src="/en-us/images/Attack_damage.svg?4c659" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Physical_damage" title="Physical damage">physical</a></span>, <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Magic damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Magic_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Magic damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Magic damage" src="/en-us/images/Magic_damage.svg?f4db1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Magic_damage" title="Magic damage">magic</a></span>, <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="True damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/True_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword True damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword True damage" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Hybrid_penetration.png/20px-Hybrid_penetration.png?d6752" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Hybrid_penetration.png/40px-Hybrid_penetration.png?d6752 2x" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/True_damage" title="True damage">true</a></span>) will always occur regardless of classification (e.g. <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Black Cleaver" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Black_Cleaver" title="An icon for the item Black Cleaver"><img alt="An icon for the item Black Cleaver" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Black_Cleaver_item.png/20px-Black_Cleaver_item.png?98eed" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Black_Cleaver_item.png/40px-Black_Cleaver_item.png?98eed 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Black_Cleaver" title="Black Cleaver">Black Cleaver's</a></span></span> Carve stacking on instances of <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Physical damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Physical_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Physical damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Physical damage" src="/en-us/images/Attack_damage.svg?4c659" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Physical_damage" title="Physical damage">physical damage</a></span> and <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Morellonomicon" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Morellonomicon" title="An icon for the item Morellonomicon"><img alt="An icon for the item Morellonomicon" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Morellonomicon_item.png/20px-Morellonomicon_item.png?e9bc2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Morellonomicon_item.png/40px-Morellonomicon_item.png?e9bc2 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Morellonomicon" title="Morellonomicon">Morellonomicon's</a></span></span> <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Grievous wounds"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Grievous_Wounds" title="An icon representing the keyword Grievous wounds"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Grievous wounds" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Grievous_Wounds_icon.png/20px-Grievous_Wounds_icon.png?053fa" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Grievous_Wounds_icon.png/40px-Grievous_Wounds_icon.png?053fa 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Grievous_Wounds" title="Grievous Wounds">Grievous Wounds</a></span> application on instances of <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Magic damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Magic_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Magic damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Magic damage" src="/en-us/images/Magic_damage.svg?f4db1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Magic_damage" title="Magic damage">magic damage</a></span>).</p></div></div><div class="blue-tooltip" style=""><div style="text-align:center; font-size:0.9em; font-weight:bold; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;"><div style="background:#163474; color:#CCC;line-height:15px; padding:5px 0 5px 0; border-radius:2px;"><div style="display:inline; vertical-align:middle;"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/20px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="21" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/40px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67 2x" data-file-width="49" data-file-height="52" /></span></span></div> League of Legends content</div></div><div style="width: 550px; margin:5px; overflow:hidden;"><div style="margin-bottom:5px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/Attack_damage.svg?4c659" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></span></span> <span class="tooltip-header" style="font-size: 140%; font-weight: bold;">Physical damage</span></div>
<p><b>Physical damage</b> is one of the three damage types.
</p>
