<b>Resurrection</b> will always take precedence over <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Zombie state"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Death#Zombie_states" title="An icon representing the keyword Zombie state"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Zombie state" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Zombie_icon.png/20px-Zombie_icon.png?e263b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Zombie_icon.png/40px-Zombie_icon.png?e263b 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Death#Zombie_states" title="Death">zombie state</a></span> effects. Entering <b>resurrection</b> does not cancel cast times. <span class="champion-ability-icon"><span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Renata Glasc" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Renata_Glasc" title="An icon representing Renata Glasc"><img alt="An icon representing Renata Glasc" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Renata_Glasc_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Renata_Glasc_OriginalSquare.png?1300f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Renata_Glasc_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Renata_Glasc_OriginalSquare.png?1300f 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Renata_Glasc" title="Renata Glasc">Renata Glasc's</a></span></span> <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Renata Glasc" data-ability="Bailout" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Renata_Glasc#Bailout" title="An icon for Renata Glasc&#39;s ability Bailout"><img alt="An icon for Renata Glasc&#39;s ability Bailout" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Renata_Glasc_Bailout.png/20px-Renata_Glasc_Bailout.png?39be5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Renata_Glasc_Bailout.png/40px-Renata_Glasc_Bailout.png?39be5 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Renata_Glasc#Bailout" title="Renata Glasc">Bailout</a></span></span></span> always takes priority over <b>resurrection</b>.<p class="mw-empty-elt"></p>
</div></div><div class="blue-tooltip" style=""><div style="text-align:center; font-size:0.9em; font-weight:bold; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;"><div style="background:#163474; color:#CCC;line-height:15px; padding:5px 0 5px 0; border-radius:2px;"><div style="display:inline; vertical-align:middle;"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/20px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="21" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/40px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67 2x" data-file-width="49" data-file-height="52" /></span></span></div> League of Legends content</div></div><div style="width: 550px; margin:5px; overflow:hidden;"><div style="margin-bottom:5px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Dash.png/44px-Dash.png?e5c61" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/Dash.png?e5c61 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span> <span class="tooltip-header" style="font-size: 140%; font-weight: bold;">Dash</span></div>
A <b>dash</b> is a quick movement action by a unit in which they move to a specific direction or location while traversing the intervening distance, ignoring the boundaries of terrain.<hr style="width:90%; border:solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25); border-width:0px 0px 1px 0px;" />
<p>
The game engine does not take into account the height of the unit; dashes that depict air travel are considered to be on the ground for targeting purposes such as <a href="/en-us/Direction-targeted" class="mw-redirect" title="Direction-targeted">skill-shots</a>.
</p><ul><li>Dashes should not be confused with <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Airborne"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Airborne" title="An icon representing the keyword Airborne"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Airborne" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Airborne_icon.png/20px-Airborne_icon.png?931fc" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Airborne_icon.png/40px-Airborne_icon.png?931fc 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Airborne" class="mw-redirect" title="Airborne">displacement</a></span> effects, which are usually sourced from enemy units (and are classified as <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Crowd control"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Crowd_control" title="An icon representing the keyword Crowd control"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Crowd control" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Stun_icon.png/20px-Stun_icon.png?cacf8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Stun_icon.png/40px-Stun_icon.png?cacf8 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Crowd_control" title="Crowd control">crowd control</a></span> debuffs).</li>
<li>Dashes are interrupted by <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Stasis"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Types_of_Crowd_Control#Stasis" title="An icon representing the keyword Stasis"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Stasis" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Stasis_icon.png/20px-Stasis_icon.png?d7c0d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Stasis_icon.png/40px-Stasis_icon.png?d7c0d 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Types_of_Crowd_Control#Stasis" title="Types of Crowd Control">stasis</a></span> (from an enemy), <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Knockdown"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Knockdown" title="An icon representing the keyword Knockdown"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Knockdown" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Knockdown_icon.png/20px-Knockdown_icon.png?929b7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Knockdown_icon.png/40px-Knockdown_icon.png?929b7 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Knockdown" class="mw-redirect" title="Knockdown">knockdown</a></span>, and <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Blink"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Blink" title="An icon representing the keyword Blink"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Blink" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Flash.png/20px-Flash.png?3cd4f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Flash.png/40px-Flash.png?3cd4f 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Blink" title="Blink">blinks</a></span>.</li>
<li>Dashes are overridden by all move blocks, which includes <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Airborne"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Airborne" title="An icon representing the keyword Airborne"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Airborne" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Airborne_icon.png/20px-Airborne_icon.png?931fc" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Airborne_icon.png/40px-Airborne_icon.png?931fc 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Airborne" class="mw-redirect" title="Airborne">displacements</a></span> and other dashes, as well as a few other cases.</li>
<li>Not all dashes can traverse terrain (e.g. <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Galio" data-ability="Justice Punch" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Galio#Justice_Punch" title="An icon for Galio&#39;s ability Justice Punch"><img alt="An icon for Galio&#39;s ability Justice Punch" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Galio_Justice_Punch.png/20px-Galio_Justice_Punch.png?593cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Galio_Justice_Punch.png/40px-Galio_Justice_Punch.png?593cd 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Galio#Justice_Punch" title="Galio">Justice Punch</a></span></span>, <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Ornn" data-ability="Searing Charge" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Ornn#Searing_Charge" title="An icon for Ornn&#39;s ability Searing Charge"><img alt="An icon for Ornn&#39;s ability Searing Charge" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Ornn_Searing_Charge.png/20px-Ornn_Searing_Charge.png?2567b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Ornn_Searing_Charge.png/40px-Ornn_Searing_Charge.png?2567b 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Ornn#Searing_Charge" title="Ornn">Searing Charge</a></span></span>, <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Vayne" data-ability="Tumble" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Vayne#Tumble" title="An icon for Vayne&#39;s ability Tumble"><img alt="An icon for Vayne&#39;s ability Tumble" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Vayne_Tumble.png/20px-Vayne_Tumble.png?0ef24" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Vayne_Tumble.png/40px-Vayne_Tumble.png?0ef24 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Vayne#Tumble" title="Vayne">Tumble</a></span></span>).</li>
<li>Some dashes gain increased distance when directed through terrain (e.g. <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Aatrox" data-ability="Umbral Dash" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Aatrox#Umbral_Dash" title="An icon for Aatrox&#39;s ability Umbral Dash"><img alt="An icon for Aatrox&#39;s ability Umbral Dash" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Aatrox_Umbral_Dash.png/20px-Aatrox_Umbral_Dash.png?9ed8d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Aatrox_Umbral_Dash.png/40px-Aatrox_Umbral_Dash.png?9ed8d 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Aatrox#Umbral_Dash" title="Aatrox">Umbral Dash</a></span></span>, <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Akali" data-ability="Perfect Execution" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Akali#Perfect_Execution" title="An icon for Akali&#39;s ability Perfect Execution"><img alt="An icon for Akali&#39;s ability Perfect Execution" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Akali_Perfect_Execution.png/20px-Akali_Perfect_Execution.png?7d0a9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Akali_Perfect_Execution.png/40px-Akali_Perfect_Execution.png?7d0a9 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Akali#Perfect_Execution" title="Akali">Perfect Execution</a></span></span>, <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Pyke" data-ability="Phantom Undertow" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Pyke#Phantom_Undertow" title="An icon for Pyke&#39;s ability Phantom Undertow"><img alt="An icon for Pyke&#39;s ability Phantom Undertow" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Pyke_Phantom_Undertow.png/20px-Pyke_Phantom_Undertow.png?2eef2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Pyke_Phantom_Undertow.png/40px-Pyke_Phantom_Undertow.png?2eef2 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Pyke#Phantom_Undertow" title="Pyke">Phantom Undertow</a></span></span>).<p class="mw-empty-elt"></p></li></ul>

</div></div><div class="blue-tooltip" style=""><div style="text-align:center; font-size:0.9em; font-weight:bold; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;"><div style="background:#163474; color:#CCC;line-height:15px; padding:5px 0 5px 0; border-radius:2px;"><div style="display:inline; vertical-align:middle;"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/20px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="21" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/40px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67 2x" data-file-width="49" data-file-height="52" /></span></span></div> League of Legends content</div></div><div style="width: 550px; margin:5px; overflow:hidden;"><div style="margin-bottom:5px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Basic_attack_cursor_icon.png/44px-Basic_attack_cursor_icon.png?03ba3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/Basic_attack_cursor_icon.png?03ba3 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span> <span class="tooltip-header" style="font-size: 140%; font-weight: bold;">Basic attack</span></div>
The <b>basic attack</b> (or "auto") is the default means by which a unit deals damage, usually equaling <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Attack_damage" title="Attack damage"><img src="/en-us/images/Attack_damage_icon.svg?51c73" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span>&#160;<span style="color:orange; white-space:normal">100% AD</span></span> <span style="color: #FF8C34; white-space:normal">physical damage</span>. <b>Basic attacks</b> are normally unit-targeted <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Edge range"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Range" title="An icon representing the keyword Edge range"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Edge range" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Range_model.png/20px-Range_model.png?9f7ec" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Range_model.png/40px-Range_model.png?9f7ec 2x" data-file-width="480" data-file-height="480" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Range" title="Range">edge range</a></span> spells, and the <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Range" title="Range"><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Range_icon.png/15px-Range_icon.png?ae16f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Range_icon.png/30px-Range_icon.png?ae16f 2x" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span>&#160;attack range</span> stat determines their reach.<hr style="width:90%; border:solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25); border-width:0px 0px 1px 0px;" />
<p>
The caster must stand still to complete a brief <i>windup</i> before launching a <b>basic attack</b>. Depending on the caster:
</p><ul><li>If a caster's attacks are non-projectile (e.g. <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Melee"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Melee" title="An icon representing the keyword Melee"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Melee" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Melee_role.png/20px-Melee_role.png?166b1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Melee_role.png/40px-Melee_role.png?166b1 2x" data-file-width="168" data-file-height="168" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Melee" class="mw-redirect" title="Melee">melee</a></span>) launching the attack deals damage immediately.</li>
<li>If a caster's attacks are <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Projectile"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Projectile" title="An icon representing the keyword Projectile"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Projectile" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Projectile.png/20px-Projectile.png?af216" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Projectile.png/40px-Projectile.png?af216 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Projectile" title="Projectile">projectile</a></span>, launching the attack sends a projectile that follows the target and deals damage upon striking them.</li></ul>
The caster then incurs a brief cooldown, based on their <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Attack_speed" title="Attack speed"><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Attack_speed_icon.png/15px-Attack_speed_icon.png?50a17" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Attack_speed_icon.png/30px-Attack_speed_icon.png?50a17 2x" data-file-width="56" data-file-height="56" /></a></span>&#160;<span style="color: #F5EE99; white-space:normal">attack speed</span></span>. Basic attacks' damage may trigger <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Proc damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Proc damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Proc damage" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Wit%27s_End_item.png/20px-Wit%27s_End_item.png?723a1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Wit%27s_End_item.png/40px-Wit%27s_End_item.png?723a1 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Damage" title="Damage">on-hit effects</a></span> only upon dealing damage. <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="On-attack"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Attack_effects#On_Attacking" title="An icon representing the keyword On-attack"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword On-attack" src="/en-us/images/On-attack_icon.svg?88ec8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Attack_effects#On_Attacking" title="Attack effects">On-attack</a></span> effects will always trigger upon the attack's <i>windup</i> completing.<p class="mw-empty-elt"></p>
</div></div><div class="blue-tooltip" style=""><div style="text-align:center; font-size:0.9em; font-weight:bold; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;"><div style="background:#163474; color:#CCC;line-height:15px; padding:5px 0 5px 0; border-radius:2px;"><div style="display:inline; vertical-align:middle;"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/20px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="21" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/40px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67 2x" data-file-width="49" data-file-height="52" /></span></span></div> League of Legends content</div></div><div style="width: 550px; margin:5px; overflow:hidden;"><div style="margin-bottom:5px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Vi_Relentless_Force_2.png/44px-Vi_Relentless_Force_2.png?9f7e9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/Vi_Relentless_Force_2.png?9f7e9 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span> <span class="tooltip-header" style="font-size: 140%; font-weight: bold;">Uncancellable windup</span></div>
Some effects cause a basic attack to have an <b>uncancellable windup</b>. Unlike normal basic attacks and similar to the cast time of a spell, the windup of these attacks cannot be <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Interrupt"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Crowd_control#Disruption" title="An icon representing the keyword Interrupt"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Interrupt" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Silence_icon.png/20px-Silence_icon.png?70ec5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Silence_icon.png/40px-Silence_icon.png?70ec5 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Crowd_control#Disruption" title="Crowd control">interrupted</a></span> by neither the user themselves nor any status effect, other than <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Death"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Death" title="An icon representing the keyword Death"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Death" src="/en-us/images/Death_icon.svg?70f06" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="52" data-file-height="52" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Death" title="Death">death</a></span>, <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Polymorph"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Types_of_Crowd_Control#Polymorph" title="An icon representing the keyword Polymorph"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Polymorph" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Silence_icon.png/20px-Silence_icon.png?70ec5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Silence_icon.png/40px-Silence_icon.png?70ec5 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Types_of_Crowd_Control#Polymorph" title="Types of Crowd Control">polymorph</a></span>, <span class="champion-ability-icon"><span class="inline-image label-after champion-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Quinn" data-skin="Original" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Quinn" title="An icon representing Quinn"><img alt="An icon representing Quinn" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Quinn_OriginalSquare.png/20px-Quinn_OriginalSquare.png?098bd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Quinn_OriginalSquare.png/40px-Quinn_OriginalSquare.png?098bd 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Quinn" title="Quinn">Quinn's</a></span></span> <span class="inline-image label-after ability-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-champion="Quinn" data-ability="Vault" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Quinn#Vault" title="An icon for Quinn&#39;s ability Vault"><img alt="An icon for Quinn&#39;s ability Vault" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Quinn_Vault.png/20px-Quinn_Vault.png?eefca" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Quinn_Vault.png/40px-Quinn_Vault.png?eefca 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Quinn#Vault" title="Quinn">Vault</a></span></span></span>, <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Hextech Rocketbelt" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Hextech_Rocketbelt" title="An icon for the item Hextech Rocketbelt"><img alt="An icon for the item Hextech Rocketbelt" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Hextech_Rocketbelt_item.png/20px-Hextech_Rocketbelt_item.png?32609" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Hextech_Rocketbelt_item.png/40px-Hextech_Rocketbelt_item.png?32609 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Hextech_Rocketbelt" title="Hextech Rocketbelt">Hextech Rocketbelt's</a></span></span> <a href="/en-us/Named_item_effect#Supersonic" title="Named item effect">Supersonic</a>, and in some cases, <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Untargetability"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Untargetable" title="An icon representing the keyword Untargetable"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Untargetable" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Untargetable_icon.png/20px-Untargetable_icon.png?c022c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Untargetable_icon.png/40px-Untargetable_icon.png?c022c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Untargetable" class="mw-redirect" title="Untargetable">untargetability</a></span> and range.<hr style="width:90%; border:solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25); border-width:0px 0px 1px 0px;" />
<p>
Any effect that would disrupt an attack's windup, aside from the ones noted above, are ignored by basic attacks with <b>uncancellable windups</b>. If the attack doesn't lock out other abilities, they may be used normally, and the basic attack will hit during the ability cast.</p>
</div></div><div class="blue-tooltip" style=""><div style="text-align:center; font-size:0.9em; font-weight:bold; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;"><div style="background:#163474; color:#CCC;line-height:15px; padding:5px 0 5px 0; border-radius:2px;"><div style="display:inline; vertical-align:middle;"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/20px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="21" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/40px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67 2x" data-file-width="49" data-file-height="52" /></span></span></div> League of Legends content</div></div><div style="width: 550px; margin:5px; overflow:hidden;"><div style="margin-bottom:5px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Fiora_Bladework.png/44px-Fiora_Bladework.png?1fcc5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/Fiora_Bladework.png?1fcc5 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span> <span class="tooltip-header" style="font-size: 140%; font-weight: bold;">Basic attack reset</span></div>
An <b>attack reset</b> is a mechanic that will result in a champion's attack timer being reset to zero. When this effect takes place during the basic attack's cooldown and not its windup, it allows the attacker to start a second attack quicker than normal.<hr style="width:90%; border:solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25); border-width:0px 0px 1px 0px;" />
<p>
Certain abilities and item actives can reset the attack timer upon use. <span class="inline-image label-after rune-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-rune="Hail of Blades" data-game="lol"><span style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Hail_of_Blades" title="An icon representing Hail of Blades"><img alt="An icon representing Hail of Blades" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Hail_of_Blades_rune.png/20px-Hail_of_Blades_rune.png?9b79e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Hail_of_Blades_rune.png/40px-Hail_of_Blades_rune.png?9b79e 2x" data-file-width="256" data-file-height="256" /></a></span></span> <span style="word-break: keep-all;"><a href="/en-us/Hail_of_Blades" title="Hail of Blades">Hail of Blades</a></span></span> generates an additional <a href="/en-us/Stack" title="Stack">stack</a> of its effect each time the user casts an ability or spell that has an <b>attack reset</b>.</p>
</div></div><div class="blue-tooltip" style=""><div style="text-align:center; font-size:0.9em; font-weight:bold; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;"><div style="background:#163474; color:#CCC;line-height:15px; padding:5px 0 5px 0; border-radius:2px;"><div style="display:inline; vertical-align:middle;"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/20px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="21" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/40px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67 2x" data-file-width="49" data-file-height="52" /></span></span></div> League of Legends content</div></div><div style="width: 550px; margin:5px; overflow:hidden;"><div style="margin-bottom:5px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Silence_icon.png/44px-Silence_icon.png?70ec5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/Silence_icon.png?70ec5 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></span></span> <span class="tooltip-header" style="font-size: 140%; font-weight: bold;">Interrupt</span></div>
<p><b>Interrupt</b> is a quality of crowd control that <i>interrupts</i> an in-progress effect, preventing its completion or causing the effect to go off at an <i>interrupted</i> state.
