<li><span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Suppression"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Types_of_Crowd_Control#Suppression" title="An icon representing the keyword Suppression"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Suppression" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Suppression_icon.png/20px-Suppression_icon.png?f6602" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Suppression_icon.png/40px-Suppression_icon.png?f6602 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Types_of_Crowd_Control#Suppression" title="Types of Crowd Control">Suppression</a></span></li></ul>
<p>The following crowd control effects <i>interrupt</i> <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Dash"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Dash" title="An icon representing the keyword Dash"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Dash" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Dash.png/20px-Dash.png?e5c61" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Dash.png/40px-Dash.png?e5c61 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Dash" title="Dash">dashes</a></span>:
</p>
<ul><li><span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Airborne"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Airborne" title="An icon representing the keyword Airborne"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Airborne" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Airborne_icon.png/20px-Airborne_icon.png?931fc" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Airborne_icon.png/40px-Airborne_icon.png?931fc 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Airborne" class="mw-redirect" title="Airborne">Airborne</a></span></li>
<li><span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Knockdown"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Knockdown" title="An icon representing the keyword Knockdown"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Knockdown" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Knockdown_icon.png/20px-Knockdown_icon.png?929b7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Knockdown_icon.png/40px-Knockdown_icon.png?929b7 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Knockdown" class="mw-redirect" title="Knockdown">Knockdown</a></span></li>
<li><span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Stasis"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Types_of_Crowd_Control#Stasis" title="An icon representing the keyword Stasis"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Stasis" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Stasis_icon.png/20px-Stasis_icon.png?d7c0d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Stasis_icon.png/40px-Stasis_icon.png?d7c0d 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Types_of_Crowd_Control#Stasis" title="Types of Crowd Control">Stasis</a></span></li></ul>
<p><span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Attack windup"><a href="/en-us/Attack_speed#Windup" title="Attack speed">Basic attack windups</a></span> are <i>interrupted</i> by all forms of crowd control that inhibit attacking. <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Ground"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Ground" title="An icon representing the keyword Ground"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Ground" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Grounded_icon.png/20px-Grounded_icon.png?1f132" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Grounded_icon.png/40px-Grounded_icon.png?1f132 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Ground" class="mw-redirect" title="Ground">Ground</a></span> and <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Root"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Root" title="An icon representing the keyword Root"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Root" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Root_icon.png/20px-Root_icon.png?80b80" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Root_icon.png/40px-Root_icon.png?80b80 2x" data-file-width="65" data-file-height="65" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Root" class="mw-redirect" title="Root">Root</a></span> only <i>interrupt</i> channeled and charged movement abilities.
