</div></div><div class="blue-tooltip" style=""><div style="text-align:center; font-size:0.9em; font-weight:bold; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;"><div style="background:#163474; color:#CCC;line-height:15px; padding:5px 0 5px 0; border-radius:2px;"><div style="display:inline; vertical-align:middle;"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/20px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="21" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/40px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67 2x" data-file-width="49" data-file-height="52" /></span></span></div> League of Legends content</div></div><div style="width: 550px; margin:5px; overflow:hidden;"><div style="margin-bottom:5px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Basic_Attack.png/44px-Basic_Attack.png?66a25" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/Basic_Attack.png?66a25 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span> <span class="tooltip-header" style="font-size: 140%; font-weight: bold;">Basic damage</span></div>
<b>Basic damage</b> (internally, BasicAttack) is a primary damage tag. The base damage of all champion <a href="/en-us/Basic_attack" title="Basic attack">basic attacks</a> as well as various attack-like abilities are usually tagged <b>Basic</b>.<hr style="width:90%; border:solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25); border-width:0px 0px 1px 0px;" />
<p>
Various effects trigger on <b>basic damage</b>. For example (the following lists effects applicable to multiple champions):
</p><ul><li><span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Plated Steelcaps" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Plated_Steelcaps" title="An icon for the item Plated Steelcaps"><img alt="An icon for the item Plated Steelcaps" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Plated_Steelcaps_item.png/20px-Plated_Steelcaps_item.png?26af3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Plated_Steelcaps_item.png/40px-Plated_Steelcaps_item.png?26af3 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Plated_Steelcaps" title="Plated Steelcaps">Plated Steelcaps'</a></span></span> and <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Armored Advance" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Armored_Advance" title="An icon for the item Armored Advance"><img alt="An icon for the item Armored Advance" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Armored_Advance_item.png/20px-Armored_Advance_item.png?3d928" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Armored_Advance_item.png/40px-Armored_Advance_item.png?3d928 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Armored_Advance" title="Armored Advance">Armored Advance's</a></span></span> <a href="/en-us/Named_item_effect#Plating" title="Named item effect">Plating</a>, which reduces incoming <b>basic damage</b>.</li>
<li><span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Hexoptics C44" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Hexoptics_C44" title="An icon for the item Hexoptics C44"><img alt="An icon for the item Hexoptics C44" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Hexoptics_C44_item.png/20px-Hexoptics_C44_item.png?dd50f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Hexoptics_C44_item.png/40px-Hexoptics_C44_item.png?dd50f 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Hexoptics_C44" title="Hexoptics C44">Hexoptics C44's</a></span></span> <a href="/en-us/Named_item_effect#Magnification" title="Named item effect">Magnification</a>, which amplifies outgoing <b>basic damage</b>.</li>
<li>Champion basic attacks, which are all <b>basic damage</b>, apply <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Life_steal" title="Life steal"><img src="/en-us/images/Life_steal_icon.svg?6c8ea" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></a></span>&#160;<a href="/en-us/Life_steal" title="Life steal"><span style="color: #CC2051; white-space:normal">life steal</span></a></span> and <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="On-hit"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Attack_effects#On_Hitting" title="An icon representing the keyword On-hit"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword On-hit" src="/en-us/images/thumb/On-hit_icon.png/20px-On-hit_icon.png?a8736" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="17" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/On-hit_icon.png/40px-On-hit_icon.png?a8736 2x" data-file-width="173" data-file-height="146" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Attack_effects#On_Hitting" title="Attack effects">on-hit effects</a></span>, though other spells may have different behavior.</li>
<li><span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Dodge"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Attack_effects#Parrying" title="An icon representing the keyword Dodge"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Dodge" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Jax_Counter_Strike_old.png/20px-Jax_Counter_Strike_old.png?95754" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Jax_Counter_Strike_old.png/40px-Jax_Counter_Strike_old.png?95754 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Attack_effects#Parrying" title="Attack effects">Dodge</a></span> and <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Block"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Attack_effects#Parrying" title="An icon representing the keyword Block"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Block" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Shen_Spirit%27s_Refuge.png/20px-Shen_Spirit%27s_Refuge.png?319df" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Shen_Spirit%27s_Refuge.png/40px-Shen_Spirit%27s_Refuge.png?319df 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Attack_effects#Parrying" title="Attack effects">block</a></span> negate most <b>basic damage</b> effects.<p class="mw-empty-elt"></p></li></ul>

<p>
Effects triggered due to damage type (<span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Physical damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Physical_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Physical damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Physical damage" src="/en-us/images/Attack_damage.svg?4c659" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Physical_damage" title="Physical damage">physical</a></span>, <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Magic damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Magic_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Magic damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Magic damage" src="/en-us/images/Magic_damage.svg?f4db1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Magic_damage" title="Magic damage">magic</a></span>, <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="True damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/True_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword True damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword True damage" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Hybrid_penetration.png/20px-Hybrid_penetration.png?d6752" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Hybrid_penetration.png/40px-Hybrid_penetration.png?d6752 2x" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/True_damage" title="True damage">true</a></span>) will always occur regardless of classification (e.g. <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Black Cleaver" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Black_Cleaver" title="An icon for the item Black Cleaver"><img alt="An icon for the item Black Cleaver" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Black_Cleaver_item.png/20px-Black_Cleaver_item.png?98eed" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Black_Cleaver_item.png/40px-Black_Cleaver_item.png?98eed 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Black_Cleaver" title="Black Cleaver">Black Cleaver's</a></span></span> Carve stacking on instances of <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Physical damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Physical_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Physical damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Physical damage" src="/en-us/images/Attack_damage.svg?4c659" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Physical_damage" title="Physical damage">physical damage</a></span> and <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Morellonomicon" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Morellonomicon" title="An icon for the item Morellonomicon"><img alt="An icon for the item Morellonomicon" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Morellonomicon_item.png/20px-Morellonomicon_item.png?e9bc2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Morellonomicon_item.png/40px-Morellonomicon_item.png?e9bc2 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Morellonomicon" title="Morellonomicon">Morellonomicon's</a></span></span> <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Grievous wounds"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Grievous_Wounds" title="An icon representing the keyword Grievous wounds"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Grievous wounds" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Grievous_Wounds_icon.png/20px-Grievous_Wounds_icon.png?053fa" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Grievous_Wounds_icon.png/40px-Grievous_Wounds_icon.png?053fa 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Grievous_Wounds" title="Grievous Wounds">Grievous Wounds</a></span> application on instances of <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Magic damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Magic_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Magic damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Magic damage" src="/en-us/images/Magic_damage.svg?f4db1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Magic_damage" title="Magic damage">magic damage</a></span>).</p></div></div><div class="blue-tooltip" style=""><div style="text-align:center; font-size:0.9em; font-weight:bold; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;"><div style="background:#163474; color:#CCC;line-height:15px; padding:5px 0 5px 0; border-radius:2px;"><div style="display:inline; vertical-align:middle;"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/20px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="21" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/40px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67 2x" data-file-width="49" data-file-height="52" /></span></span></div> League of Legends content</div></div><div style="width: 550px; margin:5px; overflow:hidden;"><div style="margin-bottom:5px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Annie_Disintegrate.png/44px-Annie_Disintegrate.png?bbde6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/Annie_Disintegrate.png?bbde6 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span> <span class="tooltip-header" style="font-size: 140%; font-weight: bold;">Ability damage</span></div>
<b>Ability damage</b> (internally, ActiveSpell) is a primary damage tag. Most <a href="/en-us/Active" class="mw-redirect" title="Active">active</a> <a href="/en-us/Champion_ability" title="Champion ability">champion</a> and <a href="/en-us/Active_ability_items" title="Active ability items">item</a> abilities are usually tagged <b>Ability</b>.<hr style="width:90%; border:solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25); border-width:0px 0px 1px 0px;" />
<p>
This damage tag invariably allows triggering <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Ability effects"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Ability_effects" title="An icon representing the keyword Ability effects"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Ability effects" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Blackfire_Torch_item.png/20px-Blackfire_Torch_item.png?3e150" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Blackfire_Torch_item.png/40px-Blackfire_Torch_item.png?3e150 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Ability_effects" title="Ability effects">ability effects</a></span> (e.g. <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Luden&#39;s Echo" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Luden%27s_Echo" title="An icon for the item Luden&#39;s Echo"><img alt="An icon for the item Luden&#39;s Echo" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Luden%27s_Tempest_item.png/20px-Luden%27s_Tempest_item.png?e80fc" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Luden%27s_Tempest_item.png/40px-Luden%27s_Tempest_item.png?e80fc 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Luden%27s_Echo" title="Luden&#39;s Echo">Luden's Echo's</a></span></span> <a href="/en-us/Named_item_effect#Echo" title="Named item effect">Echo</a>, <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Muramana" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Muramana" title="An icon for the item Muramana"><img alt="An icon for the item Muramana" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Muramana_item.png/20px-Muramana_item.png?480b6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Muramana_item.png/40px-Muramana_item.png?480b6 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Muramana" title="Muramana">Muramana's</a></span></span> <a href="/en-us/Named_item_effect#Shock" title="Named item effect">Shock</a>, <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Rylai&#39;s Crystal Scepter" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Rylai%27s_Crystal_Scepter" title="An icon for the item Rylai&#39;s Crystal Scepter"><img alt="An icon for the item Rylai&#39;s Crystal Scepter" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Rylai%27s_Crystal_Scepter_item.png/20px-Rylai%27s_Crystal_Scepter_item.png?9b9b4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Rylai%27s_Crystal_Scepter_item.png/40px-Rylai%27s_Crystal_Scepter_item.png?9b9b4 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Rylai%27s_Crystal_Scepter" title="Rylai&#39;s Crystal Scepter">Rylai's Crystal Scepter's</a></span></span> <a href="/en-us/Named_item_effect#Rimefrost" title="Named item effect">Rimefrost</a>).</p>
<p>
Effects triggered due to damage type (<span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Physical damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Physical_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Physical damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Physical damage" src="/en-us/images/Attack_damage.svg?4c659" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Physical_damage" title="Physical damage">physical</a></span>, <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Magic damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Magic_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Magic damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Magic damage" src="/en-us/images/Magic_damage.svg?f4db1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Magic_damage" title="Magic damage">magic</a></span>, <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="True damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/True_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword True damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword True damage" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Hybrid_penetration.png/20px-Hybrid_penetration.png?d6752" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Hybrid_penetration.png/40px-Hybrid_penetration.png?d6752 2x" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/True_damage" title="True damage">true</a></span>) will always occur regardless of classification (e.g. <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Black Cleaver" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Black_Cleaver" title="An icon for the item Black Cleaver"><img alt="An icon for the item Black Cleaver" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Black_Cleaver_item.png/20px-Black_Cleaver_item.png?98eed" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Black_Cleaver_item.png/40px-Black_Cleaver_item.png?98eed 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Black_Cleaver" title="Black Cleaver">Black Cleaver's</a></span></span> Carve stacking on instances of <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Physical damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Physical_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Physical damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Physical damage" src="/en-us/images/Attack_damage.svg?4c659" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Physical_damage" title="Physical damage">physical damage</a></span> and <span class="inline-image item-icon label-after item-icon" style="display:inline;white-space:pre;" data-param="" data-item="Morellonomicon" data-game="lol"><span class="border" style="display:inline-block;position:relative;" data-width="20"><span class="mw-image-border" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Morellonomicon" title="An icon for the item Morellonomicon"><img alt="An icon for the item Morellonomicon" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Morellonomicon_item.png/20px-Morellonomicon_item.png?e9bc2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Morellonomicon_item.png/40px-Morellonomicon_item.png?e9bc2 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span></span> <span style="white-space:normal;"><a href="/en-us/Morellonomicon" title="Morellonomicon">Morellonomicon's</a></span></span> <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Grievous wounds"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Grievous_Wounds" title="An icon representing the keyword Grievous wounds"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Grievous wounds" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Grievous_Wounds_icon.png/20px-Grievous_Wounds_icon.png?053fa" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Grievous_Wounds_icon.png/40px-Grievous_Wounds_icon.png?053fa 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Grievous_Wounds" title="Grievous Wounds">Grievous Wounds</a></span> application on instances of <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Magic damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Magic_damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Magic damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Magic damage" src="/en-us/images/Magic_damage.svg?f4db1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="163" data-file-height="163" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Magic_damage" title="Magic damage">magic damage</a></span>).</p></div></div><div class="blue-tooltip" style=""><div style="text-align:center; font-size:0.9em; font-weight:bold; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;"><div style="background:#163474; color:#CCC;line-height:15px; padding:5px 0 5px 0; border-radius:2px;"><div style="display:inline; vertical-align:middle;"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/20px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="21" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/40px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67 2x" data-file-width="49" data-file-height="52" /></span></span></div> League of Legends content</div></div><div style="width: 550px; margin:5px; overflow:hidden;"><div style="margin-bottom:5px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/Blackfire_Torch_item.png/44px-Blackfire_Torch_item.png?3e150" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/Blackfire_Torch_item.png?3e150 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></span></span> <span class="tooltip-header" style="font-size: 140%; font-weight: bold;">Ability effects</span></div>
<p><b>Ability effects</b> refers to a category of effects that trigger upon dealing <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Ability damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Ability damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Ability damage" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Annie_Disintegrate.png/20px-Annie_Disintegrate.png?bbde6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Annie_Disintegrate.png/40px-Annie_Disintegrate.png?bbde6 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Damage" title="Damage">ability damage</a></span>. The damage of most <b>ability effects</b> itself is in turn usually tagged <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Proc damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Proc damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Proc damage" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Wit%27s_End_item.png/20px-Wit%27s_End_item.png?723a1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Wit%27s_End_item.png/40px-Wit%27s_End_item.png?723a1 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Damage" title="Damage">proc</a></span>, which is non-reactive (= does not trigger further damage-tag-specific effects).
</p>
<p>
<b>Ability effects</b> contrast with <a href="/en-us/Attack_effects" title="Attack effects">attack effects</a>, which apply on instances of <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Basic damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Basic damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Basic damage" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Basic_Attack.png/20px-Basic_Attack.png?66a25" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Basic_Attack.png/40px-Basic_Attack.png?66a25 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Damage" title="Damage">basic damage</a></span>.</p></div></div><div class="blue-tooltip" style=""><div style="text-align:center; font-size:0.9em; font-weight:bold; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;"><div style="background:#163474; color:#CCC;line-height:15px; padding:5px 0 5px 0; border-radius:2px;"><div style="display:inline; vertical-align:middle;"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/20px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="21" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png/40px-League_of_Legends_icon_nav.png?c4f67 2x" data-file-width="49" data-file-height="52" /></span></span></div> League of Legends content</div></div><div style="width: 550px; margin:5px; overflow:hidden;"><div style="margin-bottom:5px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="/en-us/images/Spell_vamp_icon.svg?684b2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44" class="mw-file-element" data-file-width="72" data-file-height="72" /></span></span> <span class="tooltip-header" style="font-size: 140%; font-weight: bold;">Spell vamp</span></div>
<b>Spell vamp</b> is a subtype of <i>Vamp</i>, that converts a percentage of all <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Ability damage"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Ability damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Ability damage" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Annie_Disintegrate.png/20px-Annie_Disintegrate.png?bbde6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Annie_Disintegrate.png/40px-Annie_Disintegrate.png?bbde6 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Damage" title="Damage">ability damage</a></span> dealt into health.<hr style="width:90%; border:solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25); border-width:0px 0px 1px 0px;" />
<p>
For <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Area of effect"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Damage" title="An icon representing the keyword Area damage"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Area damage" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Ziggs_Mega_Inferno_Bomb.png/20px-Ziggs_Mega_Inferno_Bomb.png?af8a4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Ziggs_Mega_Inferno_Bomb.png/40px-Ziggs_Mega_Inferno_Bomb.png?af8a4 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Damage" title="Damage">area of effect</a></span> and <span class="glossary" style="white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game="lol" data-tip="Pet"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/en-us/Champion_summoned_units" title="An icon representing the keyword Pet"><img alt="An icon representing the keyword Pet" src="/en-us/images/thumb/Annie_Summon-_Tibbers.png/20px-Annie_Summon-_Tibbers.png?e6cf9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/en-us/images/thumb/Annie_Summon-_Tibbers.png/40px-Annie_Summon-_Tibbers.png?e6cf9 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a></span> <a href="/en-us/Champion_summoned_units" title="Champion summoned units">pet</a></span> damage, it is reduced to 33% effectiveness.</p>
</div></div></div>
